<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JDG" style="id">Judges</book>
  <para style="h">Judges</para>
  <para style="toc1">Judges</para>
  <para style="toc2">Judges</para>
  <para style="mt">Judges</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Josua thih hnu chuan heti hi a ni a, Israela thlahte chuan, “Kanaan-hote chu dova kan tâna bei tûrin tu nge han kal hmasa phawt ang le?” tiin, Lalpa chu an râwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan, “Juda han kal rawh se. Ngai teh u, a kutah ram chu ka pe tawh e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Judan a unau Simeona hnênah, “Kanaan-hote bei tûrin ka ram chanpualah hian lo chho ve rawh; kei pawh i ram chanpualah ka lo kal ve dâwn nia,” a ti a. Chutichuan, Simeona chu a hnênah a kal ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Juda chu a han kal a; tichuan, Kanaan-hote leh Periz-hote chu Lalpan an kutah a pe ta a; tin, Bezek khuaah mi sîngkhat an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Bezek khuaah chuan Adoni-bezeka an han hmu a; tin, an bei a, Kanaan-hote leh Periz-hote chu an that chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Adoni-bezeka erawh chu a tlân a; tichuan, an ûm a, an man a, a kutzungpuite leh kezungpuite an tansak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Adoni-bezeka chuan, “Lal sawmsarih kutzungpui leh kezungpui tan chhumte chuan ka dawhkân hnuaia buh mal an chhar ṭhîn a; ka tih ang chiahin Pathianin mi thungrûl ve ta a nih hi le,” a ti a. Tin, Jerusalem khuaah an hruai a, chutah chuan a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Juda thlahte chuan Jerusalem khua an han do va, an la a, khandaihin an bei a, khawpui chu an hâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, chumi hnuah chuan Juda thlahte chu Kanaan-ho, tlâng rama awm te, Chhim lama awm te, phaia awm te chu do tûrin an zuk kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Juda chuan Kanaan-ho Hebron khuaa awmte chu a va bei a (a hma chuan Hebron khaw hming chu Kiriath-arba a ni). Tichuan, Sesaia te, Ahimana te, Talmaia te an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, chuta ṭang chuan Debir khuaa awmte chu a bei a (A hma chuan Debir khaw hming chu Kiriath-sepher a ni).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Kaleban, “Tu pawh Kiriath-sepher khua chu beia, la apiang chu ka fanu Aksai nupuiah ka neihtîr ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Kaleba nau Kenaza fapa Othnielan a la a; tichuan, a fanu Aksai chu nupuiah a neihtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, a pasal hnên a va thlen chuan a pa ram dîl tûrin a lo fuih a. Tin, sabengtung ata a chhuk a; Kaleba chuan a hnênah, “Eng nge i duh le?” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Eng emaw dîl che ka duh a ni. Chhim lam ram ro takah mi awmtîr ta si a, tuikhur mi pe tel bawk tûrin ka ngên a che,” a ti a. Tichuan, Kaleba chuan tuikhur chhakta leh thlangta chu a pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Mosia puzawn Ken-ho thlahte chu Arad chhim lama Judai thlalêrah chuan Juda thlahte nên tûm khawpui ata chu an han chho va; an zîngah chuan an han chêng ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Juda chu a unau Simeona nên an thawk a, Zephath khuaa awm Kanaan-ho chu an that a, an tichimit vek a. Chu khawpui hming chu Horma an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Juda chuan Gaza khua a ram chin nên, Askelon khua a ram chin nên, Ekron khua a ram chin nên a la bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chu Juda hnênah a awm a; tichuan, tlâng rama chêngte chu a hnawt bo vek a; ruama chênghote erawh chu thîr tawlailîrte an neih avângin a hnawt chhuak thei lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Mosian a lo sawi tawh angin Hebron khua chu Kaleba an pe a. Chuta mi Anaka fapate pathum chu a hnawt chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Benjamina thlahte chuan Jebus-ho, Jerusalem khuaa awmte chu an hnawt chhuak lo; Jebus-hote chu Benjamina thlahte nên tûn thleng hian Jerusalem-ah an la chêng za ta reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Josefa chhûngte pawh chu Bethel khaw bei tûrin an thawk ve bawk a; tin, an hnênah Lalpa a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Josefa chhûngte chuan Bethel khuaah chuan enthlatute an tîr a (A hma chuan chu khaw hming chu Luz a ni).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, enthlatute chuan mi pakhat, khaw chhûng ata lo chhuak hi an han hmu a, a hnênah, “Khawngaih takin khawpui chhûng luhna min entîr teh khai; tichuan, ṭha takin kan ti dâwn che nia,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, khawpui chhûng luhna chu a entîr a; tichuan, khandaihin chu khua chu an bei a; chu mi leh a chhûngte zawng zawng erawh chu an zuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, chu mi chu Hit-ho ramah a lût a, khua a siam a, chumi khaw hmingah chuan Luz a vuah a, tûn thlengin chumi hming chu a la pu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Manasea chuan Beth-san khua leh a khawpera awm te, Taanak khua leh a khawpera awm te, Dor khua leh a khawpera awm te, Ibleam khua leh a khawpera awm te, Megido khua leh a khawpera awmte chu a hnawt chhuak lo; chu ramah chuan Kanaan-hote chu an awm ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Israela thlahte chu an lo chak tâk tial tial chinah chuan Kanaan-hote chu hnathawka rawih atân an awmtîr a, an hnawt chhuak fai vek ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Ephraima chuan Gezer khuaa Kanaan-ho awmte chu a hnawt chhuak lo; Kanaan-ho chu Gezer khuaah chuan an zîngah an chêng ve ta zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zebuluna chuan Kitron khuaa awmte leh Nahalol khuaa awmte chu a hnawt chhuak lo; Kanaan-ho chu an zîngah an chêng ve a, hnathawka rawih atân an awm ta zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Asera chuan Ako khuaa awm te, Zidon khuaa awm te, Ahlab khuaa awm te, Akzib khuaa awm te, Helba khuaa awm te, Aphik khuaa awm te, Rehob khuaa awmte chu a hnawt chhuak lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Asera thlahte chu chumi rama awm Kanaan-hote zîngah chuan an chêng ve ta zâwk a ni; anni chuan an hnawt chhuak lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Naphtalia chuan Beth-semes khuaa awm te, Beth-anath khuaa awmte chu a hnawt chhuak lo; chumi rama awm Kanaan-hote zîngah chuan a chêng ve ta zâwk a ni. Amaherawhchu, Beth-semes khuaa awmte leh Beth-anath khuaa awmte chu an hnathawka rawih atân an awm ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, Amor-ho chuan Dana thlahte chu tlâng ramah an hnawt chho va, ruama an chhuk an phal si lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Amor-ho erawh chu Heres tlângah te, Aijalon khuaah te, Saalbim khuaah te an awm ta reng a; nimahsela, Josefa chhûngte kut chu a chak a, an hnathawka rawih atân an lo awm ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, Amor-ho ram chin chu Akrabim chhohna leh Sela aṭangin a chho ta zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa vântirhkoh Gilgal khua aṭangin Bokim khuaah a han chho va. Tin, ani chuan, “Aigupta ram ata kha ka chhuahtîr che u a, in thlahtute hnêna chhechhama ka lo tiam tâk ramah khân ka hruai lût che u a, ‘In hnêna thu ka thlun kha ka bawhchhe tawp lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, hêng rama awmhote nên hian thu thlung suh ula; an maichâmte tihchimsak ang che u,’ ka ti a. Nimahsela, ka thupêk in pawm lo va. Eng vângin nge hetianga in tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuvângin, ‘Anni chu ka hnawh chhuahsak tawh lo vang che u, in nâkahte hlîng ang an ni zâwk ang a; tin, an pathiante chu in tân thang an ni ang,’ ka ti bawk a nih kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Lalpa vântirhkohvin Israela thlahte zawng zawng hnênah chûng thu chu a han sawi chuan, mipuiho chu râwl chhuah meuhvin an ṭap ta hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, chumi hmun hmingah chuan Bokim an vuah a; tin, chutah chuan Lalpa hnênah an inthawi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Josuan mipuite a ṭîn darhtîr hnu chuan, Israela thlahte chu mi tin mahni chanpual ṭheuh ram chu luah tûrin an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Josua dam chhûng leh upaho Josua khûma damte, Lalpan Israel-te tâna thil ropui tak a tih zawng zawng hmu ṭhîntute dam chhûng chuan mipuiten Lalpa rawng an bâwl ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, Nuna fapa Josua, Lalpa chhiahhlawh chu kum za leh kum sâwm miin a thi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Gaas tlâng hmâr lampang, Ephraim tlâng rama ama chanpual ramri chhûng, Timnath-heres khuaah chuan an phûm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, chûng chhuan zawng zawngte pawh chu an thlahtute hnên lamah an kal khâwm zo ta a, chu mite hnuah chuan Lalpa leh Israel-te tâna a thiltihte pawh hre lo chhuan dang an lo awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chuan Lalpa mit hmuhin thil sual an lo ti a, Baal-hote rawng an bâwl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa , an thlahtute Pathian, Aigupta ram ata hruai chhuaktu kha an hawisan a; pathian dang, an kiang vêla awmho pathiante zînga mi chu an zui a, chibai an bûk ta a; tichuan, Lalpa chu an tithinur ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chu an hawisan a, Baala leh Astarothia rawng an bâwl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa thin chu Israel-te chungah chuan a ur ta a, anmahni rawk ṭhîntute kutah chuan a pe ta hlawm a, an hmêlma, an kiang vêla awmte hnênah chuan a hralh a; tichuan, an hmêlmate chu an chelh ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khawiah pawh kal sela, Lalpa kut chu an chungah a chhe lamin a tla zêl a, Lalpan a lo sawi tawh ang leh, Lalpan an hnêna chhechhama a lo sawi tawh ang khân. Tichuan, mangan namênin an mangang ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan rorêltute a siamsak a, chûngte chuan anmahni rawktute kut ata chu an rawn chhan chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuti chung pawhin an rorêltute thu chu an pawm lo va, pathian dangte lakah chuan an uirê a, chibai an lo bûk ta zâwk a. An thlahtuten Lalpa thupêkte pawma an zawh ṭhin kawng chu an pênsan ta thuai mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan rorêltute a siamsak chuan, Lalpa chu rorêltu hnênah chuan a awm a, rorêltu dam chhûng chuan an hmêlmate kut ata chu a chhan chhuak zêl a; anmahni hnehchhiah leh timangangtute avângin an rûm a; chuvângin, Lalpa chu a inchhîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nimahsela, heti hi a ni a, rorêltu chu a thih veleh an hnungtawlh leh ta a; pathian dangte rawng bâwla, chibai bûk thûah an thlahtute ai mahin an lo che chhe lehzual ta a. An thiltih ṭhinte leh an luhlulte pawh an bâng hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thin chu Israel-te chungah chuan a ur ta a; tichuan, “He hnam hian an thlahtute thu ka pêk, ka thuthlun chu an bawhchhia a, ka thu an pawm ta si lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />chuvângin, kei pawhin tûn achinah zawng, Josua thih hmaa hnawh chhuah bâk hnamte hi ka hnawh chhuahsak tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />An thlahtute zawh ang khân Lalpa dân an zawh dâwn nge dâwn lo tih Israel-hote fiah nân anmahni chu ka hmang ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpan chûng hnamte chu hnawt chhuak nghâl ta lovin a awmtîr ta a; Josua kutah pawh a pe ta hek lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hêng hnamte hi a ni Lalpan Israel-te Kanaan rama râl la bei ve ngai hauh lo fiahna tûra a awmtîrte chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />chûng Israela thlah chhuanho, tûn hmaa eng mah la hre hauh lote chuan an lo hriat nân leh râl beih dân zirtîr tûr atân chauh awmtîr an ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />chûngte chu Philistia-ho lal panga te, Kanaan mi zawng zawng te, Zidon-hote, Lebanon tlânga awm Hiv-hote an ni, Baal-hermon tlâng aṭanga Hamath khaw luhna thlengin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpan Mosia hmanga an thlahtute thu a lo pêkte kha, an pawm dâwn leh dâwn loh hriat nân chûngho chu Israel-te fiahna tûr an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chu Kanaan-hote, Hit-hote, Amor-hote, Periz-hote, Hiv-hote, Jebus-hote zîngah chuan an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, an fanute chu nupuiah an nei a, an fanute chu an fapate an neihtîr thung a; an pathiante rawng an bâwl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chuan Lalpa mit hmuhin thil sual an lo ti ta a, Lalpa an Pathian chu an theihnghilh a, Baal-ho leh Aseri-te rawng an bâwl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa thin chu Israel-te chungah chuan a ur ta a, Mesopotamia ram lal Kusan-risathaima hnênah a hralh ta a; tichuan, Israela thlahte chu Kusan-risathaima thu hnuaiah kum riat an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chuan Lalpa an auh veleh Lalpan Israela thlahte chu chhandamtu a siamsak a, chu mi chuan a chhandam ta a, chu chu Kaleba nau Kenaza fapa Othniela a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa thlarau chu a chungah a lo thleng a; tichuan, Israel-te ro a rêlsak ta a. Râl bei tûrin a va thawk a; tin, Lalpan Mesopotamia ram lal Kusan-risathaima chu a pe a; Kusan-risathaima chu a hneh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, ram chu kum sawmli râlmuangin a awm a. Tin, Kenaza fapa Othniela chu a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chuan Lalpa mit hmuhin thil sual an lo ti leh ta a. Chutichuan, Lalpa mit hmuha thil an lo tihsual avângin Lalpan Moab lal Eglona chu Israel-te laka chakin a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan Amona thlahte leh Amalek-hote a pun khâwm a, Israel-hote chu a va bei a, tûm khawpui chu a luah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, Israela thlahte chu Moab lal Eglona thu hnuaiah kum sâwm leh kum riat an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nimahsela, Israela thlahte chuan Lalpa an han auh veleh Lalpan Gera fapa Ehuda, Benjamin mi, veikhawr, chhandamtu a siamsak a. Amah chu Israela thlahte chuan Moab lal Eglona pêk tûrin lâwmman an kentîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Ehuda chuan khandaih hriam tawn, tawng chena seiin a chher a; chu chu a malpui ding lam puan hnuaiah a taivawn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Moab lal Eglona chu lâwmman chu a han pe a; Eglona chu mi thau tak a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Ehudan lâwmman a han pêk zawh veleh chuan lâwmman kengtute chu a kaltîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ani erawh chu Gilgal khaw kianga lung chherna hmun aṭangin a lêt leh a, “I e lalpa, thurûk hrilh tûr che ka nei e,” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Ngawi ṭhiap rawh u,” a ti a. Tichuan, a bula dingho zawng zawngte chuan an chhuahsan ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Ehuda chu a hnênah a va kal a; ani chu a thlan daihna pindanah amah chauhvin a lo ṭhu a. Tin, Ehuda chuan, “Pathianin i hnêna sawi tûr thu mi chah e,” a ti a. Tichuan, lal chu a ṭhutphah ata chu a tho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Ehuda chuan a kut vei lamin a malpui ding lama khandaih chu a han phawi a, a pumah a chiu ta vak mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A fawng pawh chu a lût pil hmawk a, a hnungah a tlang a ni; tin, a khandaih chu thauvin a hnawh tlat avangin a phawi lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutichuan, Ehuda chu hulhliapah a chhuak a, pindan kawngkhârte chuan a khârkhung a, a kalh ta tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, chutia a chhuah tâk hnu chuan chhiahhlawhte chu an lo kal a; tin, an han hmuh chuan ngai teh, pindan kawngkate chu a lo inkalh tlat mai a, “A thlan daihna pindanah a inthiarfihlîm rih a ni ang chu maw,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, hrilhai khawpa an nghah reng hnu pawhin pindan kawngkate chu a hawng ta hauh lo mai a. Chutichuan, chabi an la a, an han hawng a. Ngai teh, an lalpa chu chhuatah chuan thiin a lo lum dêr mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Ehuda lah chu khatia an nghah reng chhûng khân a lo tlân bo tawh a. Lung chherna hmun kha a pêl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Seira-ah a tlân a. Tin, heti hi a ni a, chumi hmun a thlen chuan Ephraim tlâng ramah chuan tawtawrâwt a hâm a; tin, Israela thlahte chu tlâng ram ata a hnênah an chhuk a, ani chuan an hma a hruai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Mi zui rawh u khai, Lalpan in hmêlma Moab-hote hi a pe tawh che u a ni,” a ti a. Tichuan, an zui thla a, Moab ram dep Jordan lui kaite chu an chhuhsak a, tu mah an kaitîr lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chumi ṭum chuan Moab-ho singkhat lai, mi âwmkhauh ṭhiau leh mi chak huaisen ṭha ṭhiau an that a; pakhat mah tlân chhuak an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chutichuan, chumi ni chuan Moab-hote chu Israel-hote lakah an tlâwm ta a; tin, ram chu kum sawmriat chhûng râlmuangin a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, a hnuah chuan Anatha fapa Samgara a lo lang ve a, chu mi chuan Philistia-ho mi zaruk chu sebâwng chhunna tiangin a chhun hlum a; amah bawk chuan Israel-hote chu a chhandam a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ehuda thih hnu chuan Israela thlahten Lalpa mit hmuhin thil sual an lo ti leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, Hazor khaw ṭhuttu, Kanaan ram lal Jabina hnênah chuan Lalpan a hralh ta a. Chu mi sipai hotu ber chu Sisera a ni a, Jentail-te ram Haroseth khuaa awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chuan Lalpa an au va; Jabina chuan thîr tawlailîr zakua lai a nei a; tin, kum sawmhnih chhûng zet Israela thlahte chu nasa takin a lo hnehchhiah tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, chûng lai chuan zâwlnei Debori, Lapidotha nupuiin Israel-te ro a rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ephraim tlâng rama Rama leh Bethel khaw inkara Debori tûm thing hnuaiah a awm ṭhîn a; tin, Israela thlahte chu a hnênah an ro rêltîr tûrin an kal ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Kedes-naphtali ram ata Abinoama fapa Baraka chu a chah a, a hnênah, “ Lalpa , Israel-te Pathianin, ‘Tabor tlângah han kal langin, Naphtalia thlahte leh Zebuluna thlahte mi sîngkhat hruai rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, Kison luiah Jabina sipai hotu Sisera chu a tawlailîrte leh a hote nên ka rawn tîr ang a; tin, ani chu ka pe che,’ tiin thu a pe a ni lâwm ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Barakan a hnênah, “Mi kalpui la; tichuan, ka kal ang e; mi kalpui dâwn loh erawh chuan ka kal lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Ka kalpui mawlh ang che; amaherawhchu, i kalnaah chuan hmingṭhat i hlawh dâwn lo a nih chu; Lalpan Sisera chu hmeichhe hnênah a hralh dâwn a ni e,” a ti a. Tin, Debori chu a tho va, Baraka hnênah Kedes khaw lamah chuan a kal ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Baraka chuan Zebulun-ho leh Naphtali-ho chu Kedes-ah a chah khâwm a; mi sîngkhat amah nên an han kal a, Debori pawh a hnênah chuan a han kal ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Ken mi Hebera chu Ken mi Mosia puzawn Hobaba thlahte zîng ata a lo awm hrang a, Kedes kianga Zaananim rama sasaw thing hmun daiah a puan in a va zâr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Abinoama fapa Baraka chu Tabor tlângah a chho tih Sisera an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, Sisera chuan a tawlailîr zawng zawng, thîr tawlailîr zakua leh a hote chu Jentail-te ram Haroseth khua ata, Kison luiah a khâwm chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, Debori chuan Baraka hnênah, “Khai le, vawiin hi Lalpan Sisera a pêk ni che a ni e. I hma hruaitu chu Lalpa a ni lâwm ni?” a ti a. Tichuan, Baraka chu Tabor tlâng ata a chhuk a, mi sîngkhatin an zui thla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Sisera leh a tawlailîr zawng zawng leh, a sipaiho zawng zawngte chu khandaihin Baraka hmaah chuan a tibuai ta nuai hlawm a; tin, Sisera chu a tawlailîr ata a chhuk a, kein a tlân bo ta daih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Baraka erawh chuan tawlailîrte leh sipaiho chu Jentail ram Haroseth thleng chuan a ûm ta a; tichuan, Sisera sipaiho zawng zawngte chu khandaihin an that vek a; pakhat mah dam an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sisera erawh chu Ken mi Hebera nupui Jaeli puan inah kein a tlân lût a; Hazor lal Jabina leh Ken mi Hebera chhûngte chu inrem reng an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Jaeli chu Sisera hmuak tûrin a lo chhuak a, a hnênah, “Ka pu, lo lût rawh, ka hnênah lo lût rawh; hlau suh,” a ti a. Tichuan, puan in chhûngah chuan a hnênah a lût ta a; tin, ani chuan puanin a khuh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, a hnênah, “Khawngaih takin tui tlêm te mi han pe teh khai, ka tui a hâl êm mai e,” a ti a. Tin, bâwnghnute ûm a han hawng a, a intîr a, a khuh leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, a hnênah, “Puan in kawngkaah khân ding la; tichuan, ‘Hetah hian mi an awm em?’ tia an rawn zawh che chuan, ‘Awm lo,’ lo ti zêl ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutichuan, Hebera nupui Jaeli chuan puan in khenkilhna a la a, tuboh a keng a, zawi tein a phei a, khenkilhna chuan a bekbawrah a khêng a, a khêng tlang a, leiah a bûr ta ngur mai a; a chauvin a mut a tui hle mai si a; tichuan, a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, Barakan Sisera a rawn ûm chu va hmuah tumin Jaeli chu a va chhuak a, a hnênah, “Lo kal teh khai, i mi zawna chu ka lo entîr teh ang che,” a ti a. Tichuan, a hnênah a va kal a; tin, ngai teh, Sisera chu a lo thi reng mai a, puan in khenkilhna chu a bekbawrah a lo bûr ngur mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutichuan, Pathianin chumi ni chuan Israela thlahte hmaah Kanaan ram lal Jabina chu a titlâwm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tichuan, Israela thlahte chu Kanaan ram lal Jabina lakah an lo chak ta deuh deuh va, Kanaan ram lal Jabina chu chhe dêr khawpin an lo siam ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, Debori leh Abinoama fapa Baraka chuan chumi ni chuan:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Hotute chuan Israel zîngah zai an zâp a. Mipuite chu châk takin an lo inpêk tâk hi, Lalpa chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw, nangni lalte u, lo ngaithla ula; Aw, nangni hotute u, beng lo chhi rawh u; Keimah ngeiin Lalpa chawimawiin hla ka sa ang a, Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian fakin hla ka sa ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa , Seir ram ata i lo kal chhuaha, Edom phûl ata i lo kal chhuah khân, Lei chu a nghîng dur dur a, vânte pawh a lo far a, A ni, chhûmte chuan ruah a sûrtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tlângte chu Lalpa hmaah a lo khûr a, Sinai tlâng lam pawh saw Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian hmaah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Anatha fapa Samgara dam lai te leh, Jaeli dam laite khân lamliante chu a ṭhing ṭhup a. Zin veivâkte chu kawng mai maiahte an kal ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel rama khuate chu luah lohvin a ram zo va, a ram zo va, Kei Debori hi ka chêta, Israel ram nu hi ka chêt hma loh kha chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian tharte an vuan a; Tichuan, kulh kawngkhâr bulahte khân indona a lo awm a; Israel rama sîngli zet zîngah phâw leh fei kha awm rêng rêng a awm em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka rilru chu Israel-hote rorêltu, Mipuite hnêna chak taka inpete lamah chuan a awm: Lalpa chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangni sabengtung vâr chunga chuangte u, Nangni puan phah chhah taka ṭhute u; Nangni mi mirte u, chûng thûte chu puang rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thal kâptute thâwm rêng rêng hriat phâk loh, Tui chawina hmunah chuan, Lalpa thil fel tihte chu an sawi an sawi ang, Israel ram chunga a thil fel tihte ngei chu. Chutichuan, Lalpa mipuite chu kulh kawngkhâr lamahte chuan an zu chhuk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Harh la, harh la, Debor; harh la, harh la, hla sa rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, mi lian la awm chhunte leh mipuite chu an lo chhuk a; Mi chak tak mi beihpui tûrin Lalpa chu a lo chhuk ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amaleka zungzâmte chu Ephraim aṭangin an lo chhuk a; Benjamin, i mite zînga miten an rawn zui che, Makir aṭangin ram rorêltute an lo chhuk; Tin, Zebulun aṭangin ziaktu tiangkengtute chu an lo chhuk,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Isakar mi liante chu Debori hnênah an tel a; Isakara angin Baraka pawh Ruam lamah chuan amah nên an tlân chhuk chiam a. Reuben-ho tui luannaahte chuan; An tum a urh hle mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Eng atân nge berâm huang kârahte i ṭhut reng, Berâm rual kohna phênglâwng ngaithla tûr maiin? Reuben-ho tui luannaahte chuan ngun taka inngaihtuah chhuahna a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Gilead-ho chu Jordan râlah an awm reng a; Tin, Dan-ho chu engah nge lawngahte an awm reng? Aser-ho chu tuifinriat kamah an ṭhu hle hle a, an litengsâwlahte chuan an awm reng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zebulun-ho leh Napthali-ho hi Phûl hmun sânga thih huam reng mi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalten an rawn bei a; Tichuan, Kanaan lalte chuan Megido tui kiang, Taanak khuaah an bei a; Sum lâk rêng an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Vân aṭangin an rawn bei a; Arsiten an hmun aṭangin Sisera chu an rawn bei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kison luiin anni chu a hnâwl vek a, Hmasâng lui, Kison lui chuan. Aw ka thlarau, chak takin kal zêl rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tichuan, sakawrte chu an per ta tlut tlut a, Sakawr chakte chu an zuan an zuan avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />‘Meroz chu ânchhia lawh ru,’ Lalpa vântirhkohvin a ti. ‘Chuta awmte chu nasa takin ânchhia lawh rawh u; Lalpa ṭanpuiin, Lalpan mi chak tak a beihnaa ṭanpui tûra an lo kal loh vângin.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hmeichhia azawngah Jaeli, Ken mi Hebera nupui hi engthâwl ber a ni ang, Hmeichhia puan ina chêngho azawngah chuan engthâwl ber a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ani chuan tui a rawn dil a, hnute tui a lo pe a, Mi ṭha novin hnute tui khal a lo pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kilhna a keng a, A ding lamin hnathawk mi tuboh; Tin, tuboh chuan Sisera chu a khêng a, A luah a khêng tlang a; A ni, a bekbawrah chuan a khêng a, A khêng bûr ta ngur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A ke bulah a awp rawk a, a tlu bawk ta dêr a; A ke bulah a awp rawk a, a tlu ta a; A awp rawkna hmunah chuan a thi ta dêr mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Sisera nu chu tukverhah a han dâk a, Zâwngdaikalh âwngah a au va, ‘Engati nge a tawlailîr a lo thlen har? Engati nge a tawlailîr a muan?’ a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A hmeichhe fingten an lo chhâng a, A ni, amah a inchhâng chawp leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />‘An hmu zo ta lo vem ni? Râllâk an insem ta lo vem ni le? Mi tinin nula pahnih khat emaw ṭheuh; Sisera chan tûr chu râllâk puan ze hrang hrang, Râllâk puan zeh mawi, ze hrang hrang, Râllâk nghâwnga bah tûr puan a khing hniha zeh mawi, ze hrang hrang,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutiang chuan aw Lalpa , i hmêlmate zawng zawng chu boral vek sela! Amah hmangaihtute erawh chu chak taka kal, nî ang hi ni rawh se,” tiin hla an sa a. Tin, ram chu kum sawmli chhûng râlmuangin a awm a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chuan Lalpa mit hmuhin thil an lo tisual leh ta a; tichuan, Lalpan Midian-ho kutah kum sarih a awmtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Midian-hote chu Israel-hote lakah chuan an lo chak ta hle a. Midian-hote avâng chuan Israela thlahte chu tlângah te, pûkah te, kulhah te an biru a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Israel-hoten thil an han chîn te hian Midian-hote, Amalek-hote, khawchhak fateho chu an han chho va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />an han bei a, awm hmun an han khuar a, Gaza thlengin leia thil ṭote chu an tihchhiatsak a, Israel ramah ei tûr rêng rêng an zuah lo, berâm te, bâwng te, sabengtung te lamin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An ran rualte leh an puan inte nên an thawk a, khau ang maiin tam tak an thawk si ṭhîn a; anmahni leh an sanghâwngseite chu chhiar sên pawh an ni lo; ram chu tichhe tûrin an kal ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israel-hote chu Midian-ho avâng chuan an lo rethei ta hle mai a; tin, Israela thlahte chuan Lalpa chu an au ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Midian-ho avânga Israela thlahten Lalpa an han auh veleh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpan Israela thlahte hnênah chuan zâwlnei a rawn tîr a, ani chuan an hnênah, “ Lalpa , Israel-te Pathianin heti hian a ti a ni, ‘Aigupta ram ata ka hruai chho che u a, bâwih ata ka hruai chhuak che u a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aigupta-ho kut ata leh, hnehchhiahtu che u zawng zawng kut ata chu ka chhan chhuak che u a, in hma ata anmahni chu ka hnawt chhuak a, an ram chu ka pe che u a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tin, keiin, “Kei hi Lalpa in Pathian ka nih hi, hêng in awmna ram neitu Amor-ho pathiante hi in hlau hlek tûr a ni lo ve,” ka ti a; nimahsela, ka thusawi chu in pawm si lo,’ a ti e,” a ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa vântirhkoh a lo kal a, Ophra khuaa Abiezrit mi Joasa sasaw thing hnuaiah a ṭhu a; tin, a fapa Gideonan Midian-hote hmuh theih loh tûrin grêp sâwrna khurah buh a lo vua a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa vântirhkoh chu a hnênah a rawn inlâr a, a hnênah, “Nang mi chak huaisen, Lalpa chu i hnênah a awm e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Gideonan a hnênah, “Aw ka pu, Lalpa kan hnêna a awm si chuan, eng tizia nge hetianga kan chunga thil a lo thlen si? Min thlahtute khân, ‘ Lalpan Aigupta ram ata chu min hruai chho a ni lâwm ni?’ tia a thiltih mak tak takte min hrilh ṭhinte kha khawiah nge a nih zawh tâk? Tûnah zawng Lalpan min thlauthla dêr tawh a, Midian-ho kutah min pe tawh alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan amah chu a en a, a hnênah, “He i chakna hian kal la, Israel-ho hi Midian-ho lak ata chhandam ang che. Ka tîr che a ni lâwm ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “Aw Lalpa , engtin nge Israel-hote hi ka han chhandam tehlul ang? Ngai teh, Manasea thlah zîngah hnam rethei ber kan ni a, kei lah hi ka pa chhûngte zînga tê ber ka ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan a hnênah, “I hnênah ka awm zêl dâwn alâwm; tichuan, Midian-ho chu pakhat ang maiin i hneh vek mai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “I mit tlung ka lo nih chuan, nangmah ngeiin mi bia a ni tih chhinchhiahna eng emaw mi entîr ta che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />I hmaa hlan tûr thilpêk ka va lâka, i hnêna ka lo kal leh hma loh chuan heta ta hi khawngaih takin lo kal bo hauh suh ang che,” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “I lo kal leh hma loh chu ka lo awm reng ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Gideona chu a lût ta a, kêlno leh chhangphut epha khat, dawidim telh loh a buatsaih a. A sa chu fawngah a dah a, a tui chu bêlah a dah a; tin, sasaw thing hnuaiah a hnênah chuan a rawn keng a, a rawn hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Pathian vântirhkoh chuan a hnênah, “Sa leh chhang dawidim telh loh kha la langin, he lung chungah hian dah la, a tui kha bun chhuak rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutiang chuan a han ti a. Chutichuan, Lalpa vântirhkoh chuan a tiang ken hmâwr chuan sa leh chhang dawidim telh loh chu a han khawih a; tin, lung aṭang chuan mei a lo chhuak a, sa leh chhang dawidim telh loh chu a kâng ral ta vek a. Tin, Lalpa vântirhkoh chu a hmuh theih lohvah a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutichuan, Gideona chuan Lalpa vântirhkoh a ni tih a hre ta a. Tin, Gideonan, “E khai aw, aw Lalpa Pathian! Lalpa vântirhkoh chu a hmaichhan ngeiah ka hmuh tâk chu le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan a hnênah, “Thlamuang takin awm la; hlau suh, i thi lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chutichuan, Gideonan chutah chuan Lalpa tân maichâm a siam a, Jehova-salom a vuah a. Tûn thlengin Abiezrit mite khua Ophra-ah a la awm reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, chu zân vêkah chuan Lalpan a hnênah, “I pa bâwngpa, bâwngpa pahnihna kum sarih mi chu la langin, i pa neih Baala maichâm hi tichim la, a bula Aseri hi kit rawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tin, he kulh chungah hian kawng zâwng nei têin Lalpa i Pathian tân maicham siam langin, bâwngpa pahnihna chu la la, Aseri i kih tûr thing hmangin hâlral thilhlan hlân rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chutichuan, Gideona chuan a chhiahhlawhte zînga mi sâwm a hruai a, Lalpan a hnêna a sawi ang chuan a ti ta a; tin, heti hi a ni a, a pa chhûngte leh khawpuia mite chu a hlauh avângin chhûnah a ti ngam lo va, zânah a ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, khawpuia mite chu zîng taka an han thawh chuan ngai teh, Baala maichâm chu tihchimin a lo awm a, a bula Aseri chu kih thlûkin a lo awm a, maichâm siam chunga bâwngpa pahnihna hlan chu a lo awm ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Hei tu tih nge maw ni chu le?” tiin an inbe hlawm a. Tin, an han inzawha, an han indap vêl hnu chuan, “Joasa fapa Gideona tih a lo ni reng alâwm maw le,” an ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tichuan, khawpuia mite chuan Joasa hnênah, “I fapa chu han hruai chhuak rawh, a thi ngei tûr a ni; Baala maichâm a tihchim avâng leh a bula Aseri a kih avângin,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Joasa chuan amah rawn khingtu zawng zawngte hnênah chuan, “Baala chu in ṭan dâwn a ni maw? Amah chu in hum dâwn a ni maw? Tu pawh amah ṭan apiang chu zîngah la la hian tihhlum tûr a ni! Pathian a nih chuan a maichâm tihchim avângin inṭan chawp ang hmiang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chutichuan, “A maichâm tihchim avângin Baalan amah khing rawh se,” tiin, chumi ni chuan Jerubaala a vuah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tichuan, Midian-ho zawng zawngte leh, Amelek-hote leh, khawchhak fate chu an pung khâwm chiam a; lui an kân a, Jezreel ruamah an inkulh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nimahsela, Lalpa Thlarau chu Gideona chungah a lo thleng a; tin, tawtawrâwt a han hâm a, Abiezrit-ho chuan an pan khâwm ta chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, Manase-ho zawng zawng zîngah mite a tlântîr a, chûngho pawh chuan an pan khâwm ta chiam a. Aser-ho hnênah te, Zebulun-ho hnênah te, Naphtali-ho hnênah te pawh mite a tlântîr a; anni pawh chuan an han fin ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, Gideonan Pathian hnênah, “I sawi anga keima kuta Israel-te hi i chhandam dâwn chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />ngai teh, hruih zâwlah berâm hmul ka dah ang a; berâm hmulah chauh chuan dai a lo awma, lei zawng zawng chu a lo ro vek chuan, i sawi angin keima kutin Israel-te hi i chhandam dâwn a ni tih ka hria ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chutiang chu a lo ni ngei a. A tûk zîng taka a han thawha, berâm hmul chu a han hmeh sâwr chuan berâm hmula mi chu dai berhbu khat zet a han sâwr chhuak ta mai si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, Gideonan Pathian hnênah, “Ka chungah thinrim suh ang che, vawi khat chauh ka han sawi leh teh ang: khawngaih takin, vawi khat tal berâm hmulin mi fiahtîr leh teh ang che; tûn ṭumah chuan berâm hmul chauh chu lo hul sela, lei chung zawng zawngah dai lo awm leh thung rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, chutiang chuan Pathianin chumi zân chuan a rawn ti a. Berâm hmul chauh chu a lo hul a, lei chung zawng zawngah chuan dai a lo awm ta thung a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jerubaala (chu mi chu Gideona a ni) leh a hnêna mipui awm zawng zawngte chu zîng takah an tho va, Harod lui bulah an inkulh a; tin, Midian-hote kulh chu an awmna hmâr lampang More tlâng bul ruamah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Gideona hnênah, “I hnêna awmte kha Midian-hote an kuta ka pêk nân zawng an tam lutuk e; chuti lo zawng, Israel-hoten, ‘Keimahni kut ngeia inchhandam kan ni alâwm,’ tiin mi uan khum dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuvângin, ngai teh, mipuihote beng hriatah, ‘Tu pawh hlau leh khûr apiang chu kîr leh sela, Gilead tlâng ata hi haw leh rawh se,’ tiin puang rawh,” a ti a. Tichuan, mipuite chu sînghnih leh sânghnih an kîr leh a; tin, sîngkhat an la awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Gideona hnênah, “Mite kha an la tam lutuk fo mai; luiah hruai thla la, chutah chuan keiman ka thliarsak ang che. Heti hi a ni ang a, ‘He mi hi chu i hnênah kal ve rawh se,’ ka tih apiang chu i hnênah kal sela; tin, ‘He mi hi chu i hnênah kal ve suh se,’ ka tih apiang chu kal suh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, mipuite chu luiah chuan a hruai thla a. Tin, Lalpan Gideona hnênah, “Ui anga tui an leia a liaha liak apiangte chu a hrangin dah zêl langin; chutiang bawkin kûna ṭhingṭhia tui dâwt apiangte pawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, an kutphaha mi a liaha liakte chu mi zathum an ni a, mi dang zawng zawng chu kûna ṭhingṭhia tui dâwt vek an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpan Gideona hnênah, “Mi zathum, a liaha liakate kha hmangin ka chhandam dâwn che u a, Midian-hote hi i kutah ka pe dâwn a ni. Mipui zawng zawngte chu mahni hmun ṭheuhvah haw vek rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, mipuite chuan ei tûrte leh an tawtawrâwtte chu an keng a. Tin, Israel mi zawng zawngte chu an puan in lamah a hawtîr ta vek a, mi zathumte erawh chu a awmtîr a. Midian-ho kulh chu an hnuai ruamah chuan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, chumi zânah chuan Lalpan a hnênah, “Tho la, kulhah chuan zuk chhuk rawh khai; i kutah ka pe tawh e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, zu chhuk i hlauh chuan, i chhiahhlawh Pura nên hian kulhah chuan zuk kal phawt ula;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tichuan, an thusawi i hria ang a; chumi hnuah zawng i kut chu tihchakin a awm ang a, kulhah chuan i kal ngam tawh ang,” a ti a. Chutichuan, a chhiahhlawh Pura nên chuan kulha râl vêngho awmna tawntirh berah chuan an zuk kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Midian-hote leh Amalek-hote leh khawchhak fateho zawng zawng chu, ruamah chuan khau ang maiin tam tak an lo awm hmur mai a; an sanghâwngseite chu chhiar sên rual loh, an tam lam chu tuifinriat kama ṭiau vaivut zât zet a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Gideona a zuk thlen chuan, ngai teh, mi pakhat hian a ṭhianpa chu a mumang a lo hrilh a, a hnênah, “Ngai teh, mumang ka lo nei a; tin, ngai teh, barli chhang hlâwm hi Midian-ho kulhah hian a lo lum a, puan inah hian a lo lum lût a, a rawn tichim a, a tiletling tawp a, puan in chu a pêr ta thlawp mai a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, a ṭhianpa chuan a chhâng a, “Chu chu Israel mi, Joasa fapa Gideona ngûnhnâm a nih mai chu! Pathianin Midian-ho leh sipaiho zawng zawng chu a kutah a pe a nih chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, chuti chu a ni a, Gideonan chu mumang leh a awmzia an inhrilhfiah chu a hriatin, Pathian a be ta a. Tichuan, Israel-hote kulh lamah chuan a kîr leh a, “Tho rawh u khai; Lalpan Midian sipaihote chu in kutah a pe tawh e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, mi zathumte chu pâwl thumah a siam a, an vai chuan tawtawrâwt leh bêl ruak, a chhûnga meichher dah sa a pe ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Mi en ula, ka tih angin ti ve zêl ang che u; tin, ngai teh u, kulh tawntirh ber ka thlen veleh ka tih ang zêlin ti ve ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kei leh ka hnêna awm zawng zawngte hian tawtawrâwt kan han ham veleh, kulh vêla awm zawng zawngte pawhin tawtawrâwt in hâm vek bawk ang a, ‘ Lalpa tân leh Gideona tân,’ ti ṭheuh vang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, Gideona leh a hnêna awm mi zate chuan zân vên laita, râlvêng an inthlâk hlimchhâwn lai takin kulh tawntirh an zuk thleng a; tin, tawtawrâwt chu an han hâm a, an bêl ken chu an tikeh sawm vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, a pâwl thum chuan tawtawrâwt chu an hâm a, an bêl chu an tikeh a, an vei lamin meichher an keng a, an ding lamin tawtawrâwt ham tûr an keng a; tin, “ Lalpa leh Gideona ngûnhnâm!” tiin an au dur dur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, kulh vêlah chuan mi tin chu mahni dinna hmun ṭheuhvah an ding vek a; tichuan, sipaiho zawng zawng chu an tlân ta a; tin, an au chiam a, an tlânchhiattîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, tawtawrâwt zathum chu an hâm a; tin, Lalpan sipaiho zawng zawngte chu anmahni leh anmahni khandaihin a inbeihtîr ta chiam a; tichuan, sipaihote chu Zerera lampang Beth-sita thleng, Tabath kianga Abel-mehola ramri thlengin an tlânchhia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Israel-ho chu Naphtali aṭang te, Aser aṭang te, Manase zawng zawng aṭang te chuan an pung khâwm a, Midian-ho chu an ûm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Gideonan Ephraim tlâng ram zawng zawngah chuan, “Midian-ho hi rawn bei rawh u, Beth-bara thlengin luite chu lo lâk khalh ang che u, Jordan lui nên,” tiin mite a tlân vêltîr a. Chutichuan, Ephraim-ho zawng zawng chu an pung khâwm a, Beth-bara thlengin luite chu Jordan lui nên an lo lâk khalh vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Midian lal pahnih Oreba leh Zeeba an man a. Oreba chu Oreb lungpuiah an that a, Zeeba chu Zeeb grêp sâwr khurah an that a. Midian-ho chu an ûm ta a; Oreba leh Zeeba lû chu Jordan lui râla Gideona hnênah an rawn la a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Ephraim-hote chuan a hnênah, “Engtiziaa hetianga min ti nge i niha, Midian-ho i beihnaah chuan min sâwm ve loh?” an ti a, an hau nasa hle mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Nangni aiin eng nge ka tihuchuak bîk le? Abiezer-ho grêp lawh ai hian Ephraim-ho grêp hmaih chhar hi a nasa zâwk lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathianin Midian-ho lal Oreba leh Zeeba chu in kutah a rawn pe ta a ni a. Tichuan, nangni ai hian keiin eng nge ka lo tihuchuak theih bîk ni?” a ti a. Chutichuan, chumi thu a han sawi chuan a chunga an thinrim chu a reh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Gideona leh a hnêna mi zathum awmte chuan Jordan lui chu an zuk thleng a, an kân a, chau chung chungin an ûm zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Sukkoth khuaa mite hnênah chuan, “Hêng ka hnungzuite hi khawngaih takin chhangpêr pe teh u khai; an chau tawh êm mai a, Midian-ho lal Zeba leh Zalmuna ka ûm a ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Sukkoth khuaa mi lianhote chuan, “Zeba leh Zalmuna chu i kuta awm tawh ang renga chutia i sipaihote chhang kan han pêk mai tûr chu?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Gideona chuan, “Aw le, Lalpan Zeba leh Zalmuna chu ka kuta mi pêk hunah, thlalêr hlîng leh hnimhlîngneite chuan in taksa chu ka chhun thlêr diai duai mai ang maw le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, chuta ṭang chuan Penuel-ah a han kal a, an hnênah chutiang bawk chuan a sawi leh a: tin, Penuel khuaa mite chuan Sukkoth khuaa mite chhân ang bawkin an lo chhâng ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Penuel khuaa mite hnênah chuan, “Remna thu hâwna ka lo kîr leh hunah he kulh hi ka rawn tichim ang maw le,” tiin a sawi bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zeba leh Zalmuna chu Karkor-ah an awm a, an sipaihote khawchhak fate sipaiho thi bâng zawng zawng, sîngkhat leh sângnga laite nên; khandaih keng mi ṭhiau nuai khat leh sînghnih an thi si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Gideona chu Noba leh Jogbeha chhak lama puan ina chênghote kawngah a han chho va, sipaihote chu a han bei a; sipaihote chu râlmuang takin an lo awm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Zeba leh Zalmuna chu an tlânchhe ta a; tin, ani chuan a ûm a; tichuan, Midian-ho lal pahnih Zeba leh Zalmuna chu a man a, sipaiho zawng zawngte chu a tibuai ta nuai nuai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Joasa fapa Gideona chu Heres chho aṭangin indona ata chu a kîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Sukkoth khaw tlangvâl pakhat hi a man a, thu te a zâwt a; tichuan, Sukkoth khuaa mi lianhote leh upate hming chu a ziaksak vek a, sawmsarih leh pasarih an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Sukkoth khuaa mite hnênah chuan a han kal a, “Zeba leh Zalmuna hi en teh u le, he mite hi alâwm, ‘Zeba leh Zalmuna chu i kuta awm tawh reng anga chutia i mi chaute chhang kan han pêk mai tûr chu?’ tia mi tihel vei kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, chumi khaw upate chu a man a, thlalêr hlîng leh hnimhlîngneite chuan Sukkoth mite chu a zirtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Penuel khaw kulh chu a tichim a, khuaa mite pawh chu a that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, Zeba leh Zalmuna hnênah chuan, “Tabor tlânga in mi thahte kha mi eng ang nge an nih?” a ti a. Tin, anni chuan, “Nangmah ang bawk hi an ni; lal fa anna an nei ṭheuh mai,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Ka unau, ka nu fapate ngei an ni asin. Lalpa chu a nung ngei ang hian, anni chu lo zuah ta ni ula chu, ka that lo tûr che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, a fapa upa ber Jethera hnênah chuan, “Khai le, nangin that rawh,” a ti a. Nimahsela, tlangvâl chuan a khandaih a phawi lo; tlangvâl mai a la nih avângin a hlau a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, Zeba leh Zalmuna chuan, “Nangmah kha lo thawk la, min rawn bei ta che; patling leh patling inbeih tûr alâwm,” an ti a. Tin, Gideona chu a tho va, Zeba leh Zalmuna chu a that ta a; tin, an sanghâwngsei nghâwnga nghâwngkawlte chu a la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israel mite chuan Gideona hnênah, “Nangin kan chungah ro rêl tawh ang che, nang leh i fapa leh, i fapaa fapate chen pawhin; nangin Midian-hote lakah hian min chhandam ta si a,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Gideonan an hnênah, “Kei zawngin in chungah hian ro ka rêl lo vang a, ka fapa lahin in chungah ro a rêl hek lo vang; Lalpan in chûngah ro a rêl zâwk ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Gideonan an hnênah, “Thil pakhat erawh chu dîl che u ka duh a ni, mi tinin in râllâk bengbeh chu mi pe ta ṭheuh che u,” a ti a (Ismael-ho an nih avângin rangkachak bengbeh an nei a ni).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan, “Kan pe mawlh ang che,” an ti a. Chutichuan, puan an phah a, mi tinin an râllâk bengbeh chu an theh chhuak ta ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, chûng rangkachak bengbeh a dîlte chu a rih lam rangkachak sekel sângkhat leh zasarih a ni; nghâwngkawlte, bengbehte, Midian lalte puan sen duk tiam lovin, an sanghâwngseite khaidiat awrh pawh tel lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Gideonan chûng chuan ephod a siam a, a awmna Ophra khuaah a dah a. Chutah chuan chumi lakah chuan Israel-ho zawng zawng chu an lo uire zo ta a. Tichuan, Gideona leh a chhûngte tân pawh thang a lo ni ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutichuan, Midian-ho chu Israela thlahte hmaah chuan tihtlâwmin an lo awm ta a; tichuan, an chechâng ta lo va. Tin, Gideona dam chhûng chuan ram chu kum sawmli chhûng râlmuangin a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Joasa fapa Jerubaala chu a in lamah a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Gideona chuan ama hrin ngei fapa sawmsarih a nei a, nupui tam tak nei a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Sekem khuaa a hmeiin fapa a hrinsak bawk a, a hmingah Abimeleka a sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Joasa fapa Gideona chu tar kûna damin a thi a; tichuan, Abiezrit mi Ophra khuaa a pa Joasa thlânah an phûm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Gideona thih veleh chuan Israela thlahte chu an lo hnungtawlh leh ta a, Baal-te lakah an uirê a, Baal-berith chu an pathianah an lo siam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chuan an vêla hmêlmate zawng zawng lak ata chhan chhuaktu Lalpa an Pathian chu an hre ta lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jerubaala (Gideona chu), Israel-hote chunga theihtâwpa ṭhat chhuah ṭhîntu chhûngte chungah pawh chuan ṭhat an chhuah ve ta hek lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Jerubaala fapa Abimeleka chu Sekem khuaah a nu nuṭate hnênah a kal a, a nu pate chhûngkua zawng zawngte nên a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Sekem khuaa mi zawng zawngte beng hriatah thu sawi ula, ‘Jerubaala fa zawng zawng mi sawmsarihten in chunga ro an rêl nge ṭha zâwk in tih, pakhatin in chungah ro a rêl?’ ti teh u khai. Tin, kei pawh in thisen zawmpui ka ni tih hi hre reng bawk ang che u,” tiin a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, a nu nuṭate chuan Sekem khuaa mi zawng zawngte beng hriatah chuan chûng a thu zawng zawng chu an sawi a; tichuan, Abimeleka zui duhna rilru an lo pu ta a, “Ani chu kan unau a ni alâwm,” an ti ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Baal-berith in ata tangka sawmsarih an pe a, chu chuan Abimelekan mi ho tak tak leh mi tawrawt pui puite a ruai a, anni chuan amah chu an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Ophra khuaa a pa inah a va kal a, Jerubaala fapa, a unau sawmsarihte chu lung pakhat chungah a that hlawm a. Jerubaala fapa naupang ber Jothama erawh chu a damah a ṭang a; a lo biru hlauh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Sekem khuaa mi zawng zawng leh Beth-milo-a mi zawng zawng chu an pung khâwm a; tichuan, Abimeleka chu Sekem khuaa lungphun bul sasaw kiangah chuan lalah an siam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, chu chu Jothama an hrilh chuan Gerizim tlâng chhîpah a han ding a, aw ring takin a au va, an hnênah, “Nangni Sekem khuaa mite u, ka thusawi hi ngaithla teh u; tichuan, Pathian pawhin in thu a lo ngaithla ve dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vawi khat chu thing hi an lal atâna hriak thih tûrin an va chhuak a; olive thing hnênah hian, ‘Nang kan lalah awm ta che,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nimahsela, olive thing chuan an hnênah, ‘Pathian leh mihring chawimawi phah nâna an mi hmanna ber ka hriak hi chhuahsanin thing chungah lehlam lehlaman ka phe ka phe tehlul ang maw?’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, thingte chuan theipui kûng hnênah hian, ‘Hawh teh, nang kan lalah awm ang che,’ an va ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nimahsela, theipui kûng chuan an hnênah, ‘Ka thlumna leh ka rah ṭha tak hi chhuahsanin, thing chungah lehlam lehlaman ka phe ka phe tehlul ang maw?’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, thingte chuan grêp hrui hnênah, ‘Hawh teh, nang kan lalah awm ang che,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, grêp hrui chuan an hnênah, ‘Pathian leh mihring tilâwm ṭhîntu ka uain hi chhuahsanin, thing chungah lehlam lehlaman ka phe ka phe tehlul ang maw?’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, thing zawng zawng chuan hlîng hnênah, ‘Hawh teh, nang kan lalah awm ang che,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, hlîng chuan thing hnênah, ‘In lal atâna hriak mi thih tak zet in nih chuan ka hlimah hian lo bi ta che u; in nih loh erawh chuan hlîngah chuan mei lo chhuakin Lebanon tlânga sidar thingte chu kâng zo vek rawh se,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Chutichuan, Abimeleka in lal atâna in lo siam ta hi tihtak zet leh fel taka ti in niha, Jerubaala leh a chhûngte chu ṭha taka in tiha, a phu ang zêla a chunga lo ti te in niha
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />(ka pa hian râl a lo dosak che u a, a lo thih phah ta hial a, Midian-ho kut ata chu a lo chhan chhuak ta che u a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />vawiinah hian ka pa chhûngte chungah chuan in lo hel a, a fapate sawmsarih zet lung pakhat chungah in lo tihlum a, in unaupa a nih avângin a bâwihnu fapa Abimeleka hi Sekem khaw mite lalah in lo siam ta si a),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />vawiinah hian Jerubaala leh a chhûngte chunga tih tak zet leh fel taka ti in nih phawt zawngin le, Abimeleka chungah hian lâwm rawh u; tin, ani pawh in chungah hian lâwm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutiang a nih loh erawh chuan Abimeleka aṭang hian mei lo alh chhuak sela, Sekem khuaa mite leh Beth-milo mite chu kâng zo vek rawh se; tin, Sekem khuaa mite leh Beth-milo aṭangin mei lo alh chhuak sela, Abimeleka chu kâng zo vek rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jothama chu a tlân a, a tlân bo va, Beer-ah a tlân a, a unaupa Abimeleka a hlauh avângin chutah chuan a awm ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Abimeleka chu Israel-ho chungah kum thum a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Pathianin Abimeleka leh Sekem khuaa mite kârah chuan rilru sual a awmtîr a; tichuan, Sekem khuaa mite chuan Abimeleka chungah vervêk takin an ti ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />chu chu Jerubaala fapa sawmsarihte chunga râwng taka an tih avânga an chunga phuba lâkna a lo thlen theihna tûr leh, anmahni thattu an unaupa Abimeleka chungah leh, a unaute that tûra a kut lo tichaktu Sekem-hote chunga an thisen a awm theihna tûrin a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Sekem khuaa mite chuan tlâng chhîpahte amah châng rutute an dah a, chumi kawnga kal apiangte chu an lo suam ṭhîn a; chumi thu chu Abimeleka an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Ebeda fapa Gaala a unauteho nên an lo thawk a. Sekem khuaah an lût a; Sekem-hote chuan an lo ringhlel lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, lo lamah an va kal a, an grêp huana mi an lo va, an chîl a, an kût a, an pathian inah an lût a, an eiin an in a, Abimeleka chu ânchhia an lawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Ebeda fapa Gaala chuan, “Tu nge ni Abimeleka chu? Sekema pawh hi tu nge maw a niha, keinin a rawng kan han bâwl tehlul tûr chu? Jerubaala fa a ni lâwm ni? Zebula hi a upa a ni lâwm ni? Sekema pa Hamora hote rawng i bâwl ang u hmiang! Engah nge ani rawng chu kan bâwl ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hêngho hi ka thûin han awm teh sela chu aw! Abimeleka hi ka han titlâwm dêr mai tûr,” a ti a. Tin, Abimeleka hnênah, “I sipaite tipung la, lo thawk rawh khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, chumi khaw rorêltu Zebula chuan Ebeda fapa Gaala thusawi chu a lo hriat chuan, a thin a ur ta thut a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tichuan, fin vervêkin Abimeleka hnênah chuan, “Ngai teh, Ebeda fapa Gaala leh a unauteho Sekem-ah an lo kal a; tin, ngai teh, i chunga helpui tumin khuaa mite an fuihpawrh e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chutichuan, i hote nên a zân a zânin lo thawk ula, phûlah lo châng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tichuan, heti hi a ni ang a, zîngah ni chhuah veleh, tho la, khua chu rawn bei mai ang che; tin, ngai teh, amah leh a hote chuan an rawn beih dâwn veleh che, remchâng i tih dân ang angin an chungah lo ti mai ang che,” tia hrilh tûrin mite a tlântîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Chutichuan, Abimeleka leh a hote zawng zawng chu a zân a zân chuan an tho va, pâwl lia insiamin Sekem khua chu an hual ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, Ebeda fapa Gaala chu a va chhuak a, khawpui luhna kawngkaah chuan a va ding a; Abimeleka chu a hote nên chuan an chân rûkna hmun ata chu an lo thawk ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, Gaalan mipuite a han hmuh chuan Zebula hnênah, “Ngai teh, tlâng chhîp aṭangin mipuite an lo chhuk e,” a ti a. Tin, Zebula chuan a hnênah, “Tlâng hlim saw mihring angin i hmu mai a ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, Gaala chuan, “En ta che maw le, ram lai taka saw mipui an lo chhuk, pâwl khat phei chu Meonenim sasaw thing kawngah an lo kal saw,” a ti leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tichuan, Zebula chuan a hnênah, “ ‘Tu nge maw Abimeleka, a rawng kan han bâwl tûra chu ni?’ tia i sawina ka kha khawiah nge ni ta? Hêngho hi i mi hmuhsitate ngei kha an ni lâwm ni? Va chhuak la, va bei mawlh rawh khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tichuan, Gaala chuan Sekem-hote hma chu a va hruai a. Abimeleka chu a va bei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, Abimeleka chuan a lo ûm a, a tlânchhe ta a, khawpui luhna kawngka thlengin mi tam tak hliamin an tlu phung mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, Abimeleka chu Aruma khuaah chuan a awm ta a; tichuan, Zebula chuan Gaala leh a unauteho chu Sekem khuaa awm thei lo tûrin a hnawt chhuak ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, a tûkah chuan Sekem mipuite chu phûlah an va kal chhuak a; tin, Abimeleka an va hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, mipuite chu a hruai a, pâwl thumah a siam a, phûlah chuan an châng a. Tin, a han hawi a, ngai teh, mipuite chu khawpui ata an lo chhuak a; tichuan, anmahni chu a lo bei a, a lo that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tin, Abimeleka leh a pâwlhote chuan an lo bawh a, khawpui luhna kawngkaah chuan an va ding a; tin, pâwl hnihte chuan phûla awmho zawng zawng chu an bawh chiam a, an that ta hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tin, Abimeleka chuan khawpui chu chumi ni chuan nilêngin a bei a; tichuan khawpui chu a la a, a chhûnga mite chu a that a; khawpui chu a chhu chhe vek a, chiin a theh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tin, Sekem kulha awm zawng zawngte chuan chumi thu chu an lo hria a. El-berith kulhbîngah an lût ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tin, Sekem kulha mi zawng zawngte chu an awm khâwm vek tih Abimeleka an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tin, Abimeleka leh a hnêna awmho zawng zawngte chu Zalmon tlângah an chho va. Tin, Abimeleka chuan hreipui a keng a, thing zâr a chêk thla a, a pu ta a; tin, a hote hnênah chuan, “Ka tih dân in hmu a, ka tih ang hian nangni pawhin ti ve thuai thuai rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tin, mi zawng zawngin thing zâr chu an chêk thla ve ṭheuh va, Abimeleka chu an zui a, kulhbîng vêlah chuan an dah zêl a, kulhbîngah chuan an hâl khum ta a; chutichuan, Sekem kulha mi zawng zawngte pawh chu an thi a, mipa leh hmeichhia sângkhat lai an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tichuan, Abimeleka chu Thebez khuaah a kal a, Thebez khua chu a hâl a, a la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, chu khawpui chhûngah chuan kulhpui a awm a, chutah chuan mipa leh hmeichhia zawng zawng leh khawpui chhûnga mi zawng zawng chu an tlân lût a, an inkhâr khum tlat a, kulh chungah chuan an awm khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tin, Abimeleka chu kulh lamah chuan a han kal a, a han bei a, hâl tumin kulh kawngka bulah a kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhia tuin emaw buh râwt sawmna chung lam lung hi Abimeleka luah a zuk thlâk a, a lû ruh a keh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tichuan, a râlthuam kengtu tlangvâl chu a ko thuai a, a hnênah, “I khandaih kha phawi la, mi han that teh khai; tichuan, miten, ‘Hmeichhe thah a ni,’ mi tih loh nân,” a ti a. Tin, a tlangvâl chuan a vit tlang ta zawk a; tichuan, a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Tin, Israel-hote chuan Abimeleka chu a thi tih an hriat veleh mi tin mahni in lamah an haw ta ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Abimelekan a unaute sawmsarih a thaha, a pa chunga a tih dân kawnga a suahsualna kha Pathianin chutiang chuan a lo thungrûl ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Tin, Sekem khuaa mite suahsualna zawng zawng kha Pathianin a rawn thungrûl ve ta bawk a; tin, Jerubaala fapa Jothama ânchhia kha an chungah chuan a lo tla ta a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Abimeleka hnuah chuan Israel-hote chhan chhuak tûrin Isakar mi Dodova fa Pua fapa Tola a lo chhuak a, Ephraim tlâng ram Samir khuaah a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, kum sawmhnih leh kum thum Israel-te ro a rêl a; tin, a thi a, Samir khuaah an phûm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chumi hnuah chuan Gilead mi Jaira a lo chhuak a, kum sawmhnih leh kum hnih Israel-te ro a rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, chu mi chuan fapa sawmthum, sabengtungno sawmthum chunga chuang ṭhîn mi a nei a; tin, Gilead ramah khaw sawmthum an nei a, chûng chu tûn thleng hian Havoth-jair an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Jaira chu a thi a, Kamon khuaah an phûm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chuan Lalpa mit hmuhin thil sual an lo ti leh ta a, Baala-te leh Astorethi-te, Suria-ho pathiante, Zidon-ho pathiante, Moab-ho pathiante, Amona thlah pathiante, Philistia-ho pathiante rawng an lo bâwl ta a; tichuan, Lalpa chu an hawisan a, a rawng an bâwl ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa chu Israel-te chungah chuan a thinrim ta hle mai a, Philistia-hote hnênah leh Amona thlahte hnênah a hralh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, chumi kum chuan Israela thlahte chu an timangangin, an hnehchhiah êm êm mai a - Jordan râl Gilead rama Amor-ho rama Israela thlah awm zawng zawngte chu kum sâwm leh kum riat chhûng zet an hnehchhiah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Amona thlahte chu Juda-hote, Benjamin-hote leh Ephraima thlahte bei tûrin Jordan râl an kai a; chutichuan, Israel-hote chu mangan namênin an mangang ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chuan, “Kan Pathian chu kan lo hawisan tâk ngeia, Baala-te rawng chu kan lo bâwl tâk avângin i chungah thil kan lo tisual ta a ni,” tiin Lalpa an au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Israela thlahte hnênah, “Aigupta-ho lak ata te, Amor-ho lak ata te, Amona thlahte lak ata te, Philistia-ho lak ata te ka chhan chhuak che u a ni lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zidon-hote, Amalek-hote, Maon-hote pawhin an hnehchhiah che u a; tin, mi au va; tichuan, an kut ata chu ka chhan chhuak che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nimahsela, nangnin mi hawisan a, pathian dangte rawng chu in bâwl ta zâwk a. Chuvângin, ka chhan chhuak tawh lo vang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />In thlan pathiante chu au ta che u; anni chuan in mangan hunah chuan chhan chhuak che u ang hmiang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chuan Lalpa hnênah, “Thil kan lo tisual ta a ni! Nangin ṭha i tih ang angin kan chungah rawn ti langin; a chhan erawh chu vawiinah hian khawngaih takin min rawn chhan chhuak hrâm rawh khai,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, an zînga hnam dang pathiante chu an dah bo vek a, Lalpa rawng chu an bâwl ta a. Israel-hote manganna avang chuan a rilru a lungngai ta êm êm mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Amona thlahte chu an pung khâwm a, Gilead ramah chuan an va inkulh a. Tin, Israela thlahte chu an inkhâwm ve chiam a, Mizpe khuaah an inkulh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, mipuiho, Gilead rama mi lianhote chu an inbia a, “Amona thlahte bei ṭan tûr hi tu nge awm le? Gilead rama awm zawng zawngte chunga hotuah a awm ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Gilead mi Jephtha chu mi chak huaisen a ni a, nawhchizuar fapa a ni; tin, Gileada chuan Jephtha chu a hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Gileada chu a nupui chuan fapate a hrinsak bawk a; tin, a nupuia fapate chu an lo puitlin chuan Jephtha chu an hnawt chhuak a, a hnênah, “Nang zawngin kan pa in ro i luah thei lo vang, hmeichhe dang laka fa i ni si a,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jephtha chu a unauteho hnên ata chu a tlân bo va, Tob ramah a awm ta a; tin, Jephtha hnênah chuan mi ho tak takte an chêng khâwm a, an zui ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, nakin deuhvah chuan Amona thlahte chuan Israel-hote chu an do ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a. Amona thlahte chuan Israel-hote chu an han do chuan, Gilead-ho upate chu Tob rama mi Jephtha hruai tûrin an kal chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jephtha hnênah chuan, “Amona thlahte kan beih theihna tûrin kan hotu berah lo awm ta che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Jephtha chuan Gilead-ho upate hnênah, “Mi hua a, ka pa in ata chu mi hnawt chhuak a ni lâwm ni? Engati nge in mangan veleh ka hnêna in lo kal hi?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Gilead-ho upate chuan Jephtha hnênah, “Chuvâng tak chuan alâwm tûnah hian i lam kan lo hawi leh, Amona thlahte va bei tûra kan hnêna i kal theihna tûrin; tin, Gilead rama awm zawng zawngte chungah kan hotuah i awm ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Jephtha chuan Gilead-ho upate hnênah chuan, “Amona thlahte bei tûra mi hruai hâwn leha, tin, Lalpan anni chu mi pêk chuan in hotuah ka awm tak meuh ang maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Gilead-ho upate chuan Jephtha hnênah, “ Lalpa chu kan kârah hretu a ni ang; i thu ang angin kan ti ngei ngei ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jephtha chu Gilead-ho upate hnênah chuan a kal ta a, mite chuan hotu atân leh a puipa ber atân an lo siam ta a; tin, Jephtha chuan Mizpe khuaah Lalpa hmaah thu engkim a sawi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Jephtha chuan Amona thlahte lal hnênah chuan, “Engtiziaa hetia ka ram rawn bei tûra ka hnêna lo kal mai nge maw i nih le?” tiin palai a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Amona thlahte lal chuan, “Israel-ho Aigupta ram ata an lo chhuah lai khân ka ram an lâk vâng alâwm, Arnon aṭanga Jabok leh Jordan thlengin. Chuvângin, chûng ramte chu tlang takin mi rawn pe leh mai rawh,” tiin Jephtha palaite chu a lo chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, Jephtha chuan Amona thlahte lal hnênah palai a tîr leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />a hnênah, “Jephthan heti hian a ti e: ‘Israel-hoten Moab ram an lâksak lo va, Amona thlahte ram pawh an lâksak hek lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aigupta ram ata an lo chhuahna Tuifinriat Sen thlenga thlalêr kha Israel-ten an kal tlanga, Kadesh an lo thlen khân,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel-hovin Edom lal hnênah, “Khawngaih takin i ram kan kal tlang ang e,” tiin palai an tîr a; nimahsela, Edom lal chuan a lo ngaithla duh lo va. Tin, chutiang bawkin Moab lal hnênah a tîr leh a; nimahsela, a lo remti lo va. Tichuan, Israel-hote chu Kadesh-ah an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, thlalêr chu an kal tlang a, Edom ram leh Moab ram chu an kal hual a, Moab ram chhak lampangah an kal a. Arnon lehlam pangah awm hmun an khuar a; Moab ram chhûngah zawng an lût hauh lo a ni, Arnon chu Moab ramri chin a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Israel-hovin Amor-ho lal Sihona, Hesbon lal hnênah palai an tîr a; Israel-ho chuan a hnênah, “Kan hmun lama kal nân khawngaih takin i ram kan kal tlang ang e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nimahsela, Sihona chuan Israel-ho chu a ram kal tlang atân chuan a ring zo lo va. Sihona chuan a mite zawng zawng chu a khâwm a, Jahaz khuaah a inkulh a, Israel-ho chu a bei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa , Israel-te Pathianin Sihona leh a hote zawng zawng chu Israel-hote kutah a pe a, an that ta a. Chutichuan, Israel-hote chuan chumi ram Amor-hote awmna ram zawng zawng chu an nei ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tichuan, Amor-ho ramri chin zawng zawng Arnon aṭanga Jabok thleng rakin, thlalêr aṭanga Jordan thleng rakin an nei ta vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa , Israel-te Pathianin a mi Israel-hote hmaah Amor-ho chu a chhuhsak a ni a, nangin i neihsak theih thu em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />I pathian Kemosan i puala a lo ruatsak che chu i nei dâwn a ni lâwm ni? Chutichuan, Lalpa kan Pathianin kan hmaa a chhuhsakte chu kan nei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Moab lal Zipora fapa Balaka aiin i chak zâwk em ni? Ani chuan Israel-hote kha a chawk buaiin, a do ngai em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Israel-ho, Hesbon-ah leh a khawperah te, Aroer leh a khawperah te, Arnon ramri dep khawpui zawng zawngah te chuan kum zathum zet an awm lai khân, eng vânga la lova lo la awm reng nge i nih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chuvângin, i chungah hian thil eng mah ka tisual lo ve; nangmah zâwk hian mi beih i tum avângin ka chungah hian thil i tisual a ni e. Lalpa , Rorêltu chuan tûnah hian Israela thlahte leh Amona thlahte kâra thu chu ngaihtuah rawh se,’ a ti,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nimahsela, Amona thlahte lal chuan Jephtha thuchah chu a lo ngaithla duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa Thlarau chu Jephtha chungah a lo thleng a; tichuan, Gilead leh Manasea ram a kal tlang a, Gilead rama Mizpe aṭang chuan Amona thlahte hnênah chuan a kal zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Jephthan Lalpa hnênah chhia a chham a, “Amona thlahte hi ka kuta mi pêk tak meuh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />heti hi a ni ang a, Amona thlahteho hnên aṭanga râlmuanga ka hâwn leh hun chuan eng pawh ka kawngka aṭanga mi rawn hmuak hmasa ber apiang chu Lalpa ta tûr a ni ang a, hâlral thilhlan atân ka hmang ngei ngei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jephtha chu Amona thlahte bei tûr chuan a kal ta a; tin, Lalpan a kutah a pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, Aroer aṭanga Minith thlengin a bei zêl a, khaw sawmhnih zet; tin, Abel-keramim thlengin a that chiam a. Chutichuan, Amona thlahte chu Israela thlahte hmaah chuan an lo tlâwm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, Jephtha chuan a awmna Mizpe khuaa a in chu a thleng ta a; tin, ngai teh, a fanu chuan khuangtête nên lâmin a lo hmuak a; a fa neih chhun a ni a, amah lo chu fapa leh fanu dang rêng rêng a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, amah a han hmuh veleh chuan a puante a pawt thlêr a, “E khai, ka fanu! Mi titlâwm ta hle mai a! Mi timangangtu zînga mi i ni ta! Lalpa lamah ka kâ ka lo âng ta si a, chu chu zûk leh thei ka ni si lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “Ka pa, Lalpa lamah i kâ zu lo âng ta chia, i kâa i thuchhuak ang ngeiin ka chungah i ti tûr alâwm; Lalpan i hmêlma Amona thlahte chung ngeiah chuan i phuba zuk la ta si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, a pa hnênah chuan, “Hetiang hian ka ti ang e: thla hnih chhûng chu keimahin ka han tâl hrang ang a, tlângahte ka han rawl ang a, ka nulâtna hi ka han sûn ang e, kei leh ka ṭhianteho nên hian,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Kal ta che,” a ti a. Tichuan, thla hnih thang tûrin a tîr a; tin, a chhuak ta a, amah leh a ṭhianteho nên chuan; tin, tlângahte chuan a nulâtna chu a han sûn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, thla hnih hnuah chuan a pa hnênah a haw leh ta a, ani chuan chhia a lo chham tawh ang khân a chungah a ti ta a. Mipa tu mahin an pâwl lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israel-hote zîngah chuan Israela fanuten Gilead mi Jephtha fanu chu kum tin ni li sûn dânah an lo nei ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Ephraim-hote chu an pung khâwm chiam a, hmâr lam panin an kal a; tin, Jephtha hnênah, “Engati nge Amona thlahte bei tûra i hnêna kal tûra min rawn sâwm ve loh ni? I inah kan hâl khung dâwn che a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Jephtha chuan an hnênah, “Amona thlahteho hi ka mite nên theihtâwp chhuahin kan bei a ni a; ka chah lai che u khân an kut ata mi chhan chhuak si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, nangnin mi chhan chhuak duh lo tih ka hriat veleh thih dâwn miah lovin ka ṭang a, Amona thlahte bei tûrin ka va thawk a; tichuan, Lalpan anniho chu ka kutah mi pe ta a. Chuvângin, eng atan nge mi bei tûra vawiinah hian in lo thawh ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jephtha chuan Gilead mi zawng zawng chu a khâwm chiam a, Ephraim-ho chu a bei ta a. Tin, Gilead-hote chuan Ephraim-ho chu an that ta chiam a, “Nangni Ephraim hnam tlân bo Gilead-ho, Ephraim-ho zîngah leh Manase-ho zînga tel ve mai maiho,” an tih ṭhin avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Gilead-hote chuan Ephraim-ho dep Jordan lui kaite chu an lo man a. Tin, heti hi a ni a, Ephraim-ho tlân bote chuan, “Ka lo kai ang e,” an tih apiangin Gilead-hote chuan an hnênah, “Ephraim mi i ni em?” an lo ti zêl a. Annin, “Ni lo ve,” an lo tih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />an hnênah, “ ‘Shiboleth’ han ti teh,” an lo ti a; tin, anni chuan, “Siboleth,” an lo ti zâwk ṭhîn a, an lam fiah ve thiam si ṭhîn lo va; tichuan, an man a, Jordan lui kaiahte chuan an lo that zêl a. Chumi ṭum chuan Ephraim-ho chu sîngli leh sânghnih an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Jephtha chuan Israel-ho chungah kum ruk ro a rêl a. Tichuan, Gilead mi Jephtha chu a thi a, Gilead rama khaw pakhatah an phûm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, a hnuah chuan Bethlehem khuaa mi Ibzanan Israel-ho chungah ro a rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chu mi chuan fapa sawmthum a nei a, fanu sawmthum ram dangah a kaltîr a; tin, a fapate tân chuan ram dang mi fanu sawmthum a hruaisak bawk a. Tin, Israel-ho chungah kum sarih ro a rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Ibzana chu a thi a, Bethlehem khuaah an phûm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, a hnuah chuan Zebulun mi Elonan Israel-ho chungah ro a rêl a; Israel-ho chungah kum sâwm ro a rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Zebulun mi Elona chu a thi a, Zebulun rama Aijalon khuaah an phûm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, chumi hnuah chuan Pirathon mi, Hilela fapa Abdonan Israel-ho chungah ro a rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chu mi chuan fapa sawmli leh tupa sawmthum, sabengtungno sawmsarih chunga chuang ṭhîn mi a nei a. Ani chuan Israel-ho chungah kum riat ro a rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Pirathon mi, Hilela fapa Abdona chu a thi a, Ephraim ram, Amalek mite tlâng ramah Pirathon khuaah an phûm ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chuan Lalpa mit hmuhin thil sual an lo ti leh ta a; tichuan, Lalpan Philistia-ho kutah kum sawmli a awmtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Zora khuaah Dan hnam mi pakhat a awm a, a hming chu Manoa a ni a; a nupui chu a ching a, nau rêng rêng a pai ngai lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, chu hmeichhe hnênah chuan Lalpa vântirhkoh a rawn inlâr a, a hnênah chuan, “Ngai teh khai, i ching a, nau rêng rêng i la pai ngai lo va; nimahsela, i rai ang a, fapa i hring ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, fîmkhur rawh khai, uain leh zû rêng rêng in suh la, ei thiang lo thil rêng rêng pawh ei hauh suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngai teh, i rai ang a, fapa i hring dâwn si a. A lûah chuan bakmehna rêng rêng rawih a ni lo vang, naupang chu chhûla a awm lai aṭangin Pathian tâna Nazarit mi a ni dâwn si a; ani chuan Israel-hote hi Philistia mite kut ata chu a chhan chhuak ṭan ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, hmeichhia chuan a pasal hnênah, “Pathian mi mi pakhat ka hnênah a lo kal a, a hmêl chu vântirhkoh hmêl ang, ṭihbaiawm tak a ni; khawi lam mi nge a nih ka zâwt hlei lo va, ani chuan a hming mi hrilh bawk lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, ka hnênah, ‘Ngai teh, i rai ang a, fapa i hring ang; chutichuan, uain leh zû rêng rêng in suh la, ei thiang lo thil rêng rêng pawh ei hauh suh ang che; naupang chu chhûla a awm lai aṭanga a thih thlengin Pathian tâna Nazarit mi a ni dâwn si a,’ a ti a,” tiin a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, Manoa chuan Lalpa hnênah a ngên chiam a, a hnênah, “Aw Lalpa , khawngaih takin Pathian mi i rawn tirha kha kan hnênah lo kal leh sela, naupang lo piang tûr chu engtin nge kan tih ang min han zirtîr rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Pathianin Manoa thusawi chu a lo ngaithla a; tin, hmeichhia chu phûla a ṭhut laiin a hnênah Pathian vântirhkoh chu a lo kal leh a; a pasal Manoa erawh chu a hnênah a awm ve lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhia chu hmanhmawh takin a tlân ta thuai a, a pasal chu a va hrilh a, a hnênah, “Ngai teh, hmannia ka hnêna lo kala kha ka hnênah a rawn inlâr leh ta e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, Manoa chu a tho va, a nupui chu a zui a, chu mi hnên chu a va thleng a, a hnênah, “Nangmah hi em ni hmeichhe hnêna thu sawitu chu?” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Manoa chuan, “I thu ang zêl chuan lo thleng rawh se! Naupang awm dân tûr chu engtin nge ni ang a, eng nge ni a thawh tûr chu ni ang le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa vântirhkoh chuan Manoa hnênah, “Hmeichhe hnêna ka sawi zawng zawng kha ngaihtuah ṭha mai rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Grêp hruia mi rêng rêng chu a ei tûr a ni lo va, uain leh zû rêng rêng a in tûr a ni lo, ei thiang lo thil rêng rêng pawh a ei tûr a ni lo; thu ka pêk tâk zawng zawng kha vawng ṭha rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Manoan Lalpa vântirhkoh hnênah chuan, “Khawngaih takin kan chelh ang chia, kêlno kan han buatsaihsak rih ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa vântirhkoh chuan Manoa hnênah, “Mi chelh mah la, i chaw zawng ka ei lo vang. Hâlral thilhlan tûra buatsaih i nih erawh chuan Lalpa hnênah i hlân tûr a ni,” a ti a. Manoa chuan ani chu Lalpa vântirhkoh a ni tih a hre si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Manoan Lalpa vântirhkoh hnênah chuan, “Tu nge i hming, i thusawi ang ngeia a lo thlen huna kan chawimawi theihna tûr chein?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa vântirhkoh chuan a hnênah, “Engati nge ka hming mi zawh? Sawi mi a ni hlei nêm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, Manoa chuan kêlno chu ei tûr thilhlan nên a va la a, lungpui chungah chuan Lalpa hnênah a hlân a. Tin, vântirhkoh chuan Manoa leh a nupuiin an thlîr reng lai chuan thilmak tak a ti ta a -
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />maichâm aṭanga mei alh chu vân lama a chhoh lai chuan, Lalpa vântirhkoh chu maichâma mei alhah chuan a chho ta mai a! Manoa leh a nupuiin chu thil an hmuh chuan leiah an bawkkhup ta dêr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Lalpa vântirhkoh chu Manoa leh a nupui hnênah chuan a rawn inlâr leh ta lo. Tichuan, Manoa chuan Lalpa vântirhkoh a ni tih a hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Manoa chuan a hnênah, “Pathian kan hmuh tâk avâng hian kan thi ngei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nimahsela, a nupui chuan a hnênah, “ Lalpan min tihhlum a tum te chuan hâlral thilhlan leh ei tûr thilhlan kan hlante kha a chhâng duh hlei nâng, hêng ang zawng zawngte pawh hi min entîr lo vang a, hêng ang thilte pawh hi tûn ṭumah min hrilh hek lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhia chuan fapa chu a hring ta a, a hmingah Samsona an sa a; tin, nausên chu a lo sei lian a, Lalpan mal a sâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Zora leh Estaol inkâra Mahane-dan hmunah chuan Lalpa thlarauvin a rawn khawih harh ṭan ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Samsona chu Timna khuaah chuan a zuk kal a, Timna khuaah chuan Philistia-ho fanute zînga mi hmeichhe pakhat hi a zuk hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, a lo hâwn chhoh leh chuan a nu leh a pa chu a hrilh a, “Timna khuaah, Philistia-ho fanute zînga mi hmeichhe pakhat ka hmu a; ka nupuiah mi neihsak rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, a nu leh a pa chuan a hnênah, “I unaute fanute zîngah emaw, kan chite zawng zawng zîngah hian emaw hmeichhia an awm hauh lo vem ni le, Philistia-ho serhtan lohte zînga nupui tûr i zuk zawn tâk mai?” an ti a. Tin, Samsona chuan a pa hnênah, “Mi neihsak mai rawh; ka duh êm asin maw le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nimahsela, a nu leh a pa chuan chu chu Lalpa tih a ni tih an hre lo va - Philistia-ho chungah remchâng a zawng a ni si a. Chutih lai chuan Philistia-hote chuan Israel-hote chungah ro an rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, Samsona chu a nu leh a pa nên Timna khuaah chuan an zuk kal a, Timna khuaa grêp hmun hi an zu thleng a. Tin, ngai teh, sakeibaknei vânglai hian a lo rûm khum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thlarau chu a chungah nasa takin a lo thleng a; tichuan, kêlno pawh sawm ang maiin a pawt sawm ta mai a, eng mah a keng si lo va. Nimahsela, a thiltih chu a nu leh a pa a hrilh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, a zuk kal a, hmeichhia chu a kâwm a; Samsona chuan a duh hle mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, nakin deuhvah chuan zuk neih tumin a kal leh a, sakeibaknei ruang chu en tumin a va pêng a; tin, ngai teh, sakeibaknei taksaah chuan khuai hi a lo awm mur mur a, a zû pawh a lo awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chu chu a la a, a kal leh ta a, a kal pahin a ei zêl a. Tin, a nu leh a pa hnên chu a han thleng a, a pe ve a, anni pawh chuan an ei a; amaherawhchu, khawizu chu sakeibaknei taksaa mi a lâk a ni tih eng mah a hrilh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, a pa chu hmeichhe hnênah chuan a zuk kal a. Tin, chutah chuan Samsonan ruai a ṭheh a; chu chu tlangvâlte tih dân a ni rêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, amah an hmuh veleh a hnêna awm ve tûrin ṭhian sawmthum an hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Samsonan an hnênah, “Tûnah hian thu khirh ka zâwt teh ang che u le. Ruaiṭheh ni, ni sarih chhûnga mi hrilhfiah theiha, in hriat chhuah theih chuan puanzaisîn silh sawmthum leh inthlâkna puan sawmthum ka pe ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, mi hrilhfiah theih loh chuan, puanzaisîn silh sawmthum leh inthlâkna puan sawmthum mi pe tûr a ni,” a ti a. Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “I thu khirh chu han sawi teh le, kan lo ngaithla ang e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Eitu ata ei tûr lo chhuaka, Chak tak ata thil thlum tak lo chhuak, tih hi,” a ti a. Tin, ni thum chhûngin chu thu khirh chu an hrilhfiah thei ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, heti hi a ni a, a ni sarih ni chuan Samsona nupui hnênah, “I pasal hi he thu khirh hi min hrilhfiah tûrin thlêm rawh; chuti lo chuan, nang leh i pa chhûngte hi kan hâl dâwn a ni. Min tikawnkaw tûrin a ni maw min sâwm? A ni lâwm ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, Samsona nupui chu a hmaah a ṭap a, “Mi lo hmangaih lovin, mi hua a lo nih zâwk hi le! Ka chiteho lêm thu khirh i zâwt a, kei zawng mi hrilhfiah ve si lo va,” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “Ngai teh, ka nu leh ka pa pawh ka hrilh lo va, nang ka hrilh ang che maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, an ruaiṭheh, ni sarih chhûng zawng chuan a hmaah a ṭap a ṭap mai a. Tin, heti hi a ni a, a ni sarih ni chuan a ngen tlut tlut avângin a hrilh ta nge nge a. Tichuan, ani chuan a thu khirh chu a chiteho a hrilh ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, a ni sarih ni, ni tlâk hmain chumi khuaa mite chuan a hnênah, “Khawizû aia thlum zâwk eng nge ni le? Tin, sakeibaknei aia chak zâwk eng nge ni le?” an ti a. Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Ka bâwnglâ hian lei let suh ula chuan, Ka thu khirh hi in hre chhuak hauh lo vang le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thlarau chu a chungah nasa takin a lo thleng a; tin, Askelon khuaah a zuk kal a, mi sawmthum a that a, an thuam a hlihsak a, inthlâkna puante chu thu khirh hrilhfiahtute chu a pe ta a. Tichuan, a thin a rim ta êm êm mai a, a pa in lamah a chho ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nimahsela, Samsona nupui chu ṭhian atâna a hman, a ṭhiana kha an lo pe ta mai a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nimahsela, heti hi a ni a, a nakin deuhvah chuan, buh seng hun lai hian Samsona chuan kêlno kengin a nupui a va kan a, “Pindan chhûngah sâwn ka nupui hnênah ka va lût dâwn e,” a ti a. Nimahsela, a pain a luh a lo phal ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, a pa chuan, “Amah hi i haw hle emaw ka ti a; chuvângin, i ṭhian ka lo pe ta a ni. A nau hi amah aiin a hmêl a ṭha zâwk a ni lâwm ni? A aiah khawngaih takin nei zâwk mai rawh khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Samsona chuan an hnênah, “Tûn ṭum chu Philistia-hote pawi khawih mah ila dem ka kai lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, Samsona chuan sihal zathum a va man a; meichher a la a, an mei leh mei chu a zawm a, an mei inkârah chuan meichher chu a dah ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, meichherte chu a han hâl veleh chuan Philistia-ho buh ding zîngah chuan a tlân luhtîr chiam a, buhphal leh buh la dingte chu, olive hmunte nên lam a kâng ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, Philistia-hote chuan, “Tu tih nge maw ni le?” an ti a. Tin, anni chuan, “Timna khuaa mi mâkpa Samsona tih a ni, a nupui a chhuhsaka, a ṭhianpa kha a neihtîr avângin,” an ti a. Tin, Philistia-hote chuan an pafain an han hâl hlum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Samsona chuan an hnênah, “Hetianga in tih chuan in chungah phuba ka la ve phawt ang a, chumi zawhah chuan ka ti tawh lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, a bei vak a, a that chiam a; tin, a chhuk thla a, Etam lungpui keh kârah a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, Philistia-ho chu an han chho va, Judai ramah chuan an han inkulh a, Lehi hmunah an inzâr chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Judai rama mite chuan, “Engtizia nge min bei tûra in lo kal mai?” an ti a. Tin, anni chuan, “Samsona phuara, kan chunga a tih ang bawka a chunga ti ve tûrin kan lo kal a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, Judai rama mi, mi sângthum chu Etam lungpui keh kârah chuan an zuk kal a, Samsona hnênah, “Philistia-ho hi kan chunga rorêltute an ni tih i hre na nge? Engtiziaa hetianga kan chunga thil rawn ti ta mai nge i nih le?” an ti a. Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Ka chunga an tih ang bawkin an chungah ka ti ve ta a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “Nangmah hi phuara, Philistia-ho kuta pe tûrin kan lo chhuk a ni,” an ti a. Tin, Samsona chuan an hnênah, “Nangni chuan mi tihlum lo tûrin ka hnênah chhia chham rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “Tihlum lo ve; amaherawhchu, kan phuar tlat ang chia, an kutah kan pe dâwn che a ni; thah zawng kan that hauh lo vang che,” tiin an sawi a. Tichuan, hruizên thar pahnihin an phuar a, lungpui ata chu an hruai chho ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lehi hmun a lo thlen chuan Philistia-hovin an lo hmuak a, an lo au dur dur a. Tin, Lalpa thlarau chu a chungah nasa takin a lo thleng a; tichuan, a bân phuarna hruizên chu ziza zai kâng chat ang mai a lo ni ta a, a phuarnate chu a kut ata a tla ta tawp mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, sabengtung khabe ruh tharlâm hi a hmu a, a han ban a, a la a, chu chuan mi sângkhat a vaw hlum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Samsona chuan, “Sabengtung khabe ruhin ka tiang pâwng thêr thûr mai le, Sabengtung khabe ruhin mi sângkhat ka vaw hlum e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, thu a sawi zawh veleh chuan a khabe ruh ken chu a paih ta a; tin, chu hmun chu Ramath-lehi an lo ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, a tui a lo hâl ta êm êm mai a; Lalpa a au va, “Nangin i chhiahhlawh kut hi hmangin ropui takin mi lo chhan chhuak ta a; tûnah hian tuihâlin ka thi mai dâwnin, serhtan lohho kutah hian ka tlu lût mai dâwn em ni ang le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, Pathianin Lehi hmuna khuarkhurum chu a han tikhichat ta phuk a; tin, tui a lo chik chhuak ta a, chu chu a han in veleh a rilru a lo chak leh ta a, a lo harh ta huai a. Chutichuan, chumi hmingah chuan En-hakore an ti ta a, tûn thlengin Lehi hmunah chuan a la awm reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, Philistia-ho hun lai chuan Israel-te chungah kum sawmhnih ro a rêl a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Samsona chu Gaza khuaah a kal a, chutah chuan nawhchizuar hi a va hmu a, a pâwl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, “Samsona hetah a lo kal e,” tiin Gaza mite chu an hrilh a. Tichuan, an hual ta a, khawpui kulh kawngka bulah chuan zankhuain an châng a. Zankhua chuan an ngawi ṭhiap a, “Khua lo vâr teh phawt se; tichuan, kan that dâwn nia,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Samsona chu zanlai thlengin a mu a; tin, zanlaiah chuan a tho va, khawpui kulh kawngkhârte leh a ban pahnih chu a chelh a, a kalhnate nên lam chuan a phawi chhuak vek a, a kovah a pu a, Hebron zâwn tlâng chhîpah a pu chho ta luah mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, nakin deuhvah chuan Sorek ruama mi hmeichhe pakhat a ngaizâwng ta a, a hming chu Delili a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Philistia-ho mi liante chu a hnênah an han chho va, a hnênah, “Amah chu kan hneha, phuara kan sawisak theih nân a chakna chhan hriat tumin thlêm rawh khai; tichuan, kan zavai hian tangkarua sângkhat leh za kan pe ṭheuh vang che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, Delili chuan Samsona hnênah, “I chak viauna chhan hi mi hrilh teh khai, engtin nge sawisak tûrin phuar theih i nih ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Samsonan a hnênah, “Thalhrui thar, la ro hlek lo pasarihin mi phuar sela; tichuan, ka chak lo vang a, mi dang ang mai bawk ka ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, Philistia-ho mi liante chuan thalhrui thar pasarih, la ro hlek lo chu an han pe a, chûng chuan a phuar ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pindan chhûngrilah châng rutute a dah a. Tichuan, a hnênah, “Samson, Philistia-hovin an rawn bei dâwn a che,” a ti a. Tin, thalhruite chu meiin ziza hrui ṭawm a kâng chat ang mai hian a tichat ta mai a. Chutichuan, a chakna chhan chu hriat a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Delili chuan Samsona hnênah, “Ngai teh, mi tihder a, dâwt mi hrilh a nih hi. Engtia phuar theih tûr nge i nih mi hrilh tawh rawh khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “Hruizên thar, la hman hlek lohvin mi han phuar mai sela; tichuan, ka chak lo vang a, mi dang ang mai bawk ka ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, Delili chuan hruizên thar a la a, a phuar ta a; tin, a hnênah, “Samson, Philistia-hovin an rawn bei dâwn a che,” a ti a. Pindan chhûngrilah chuan a châng rutute kha an awm a. Tin, a kut phuarna chu lazai tihchah ang maiin a han tichat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Delili chuan Samsona hnênah, “Mi i la tihderin, dâwt mi la hrilh cheu a nih hi. Engtia phuar theih tûr nge i nih mi hrilh teh khai,” a ti a. Tin, a hnênah, “Ka sam phiar sarih hi puanah tah hnan la a ni mai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, kilhnain a kilh bet tlat a, a hnênah, “Samson, Philistia-hovin an rawn bei dâwn a che,” a ti a. Tichuan, a mu chu a han harh a, puanbu kilh behna leh puanbu chawp chuan a tithlawn ta vek mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, a hnênah, “I thinlung hi mi pe hlek si lovin, engtiziaa, ‘Ka hmangaih che,’ ti thei nge maw i nih le? Hei vawi thum tlawng i mi tihderna chu i tilang tawh a ni a, i chak viauna chhan hi mi la hrilh ta lo fo mai a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, ni tin a ngen tlut tluta, a thlêm a thlêm ṭhin avângin thihna khawp hialin a rilru a lo mangang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, a rilru zawng zawng chu a hrilh ta vek a, a hnênah, “Ka luah hian bakmehna rêng rêng rawih a la ni ngai lo va; ka nu chhûla ka awm lai aṭanga Pathian tâna Nazarit mia lo awm ka ni a. Tûnah hian lo inmêt ta ila, ka chakna chu a bo vek mai ang; tichuan, ka chak lo vang a, mi dang ang mai bawk ka ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, a rilru zawng zawng chu a hrilh ta vek tih Delili chuan a hriat veleh Philistia-ho mi liante chu, “Lo chho leh phawt rawh u, a rilru zawng zawng chu mi hrilh vek tawh e,” tiin a chah ta hlawm a. Chutichuan, Philistia-ho mi liante chu a hnênah chuan an han kal a, tangkarua chu an keng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, a mal chungah a muthilhtîr a; tin, mi a ko va, a sam phiar sarih chu a hlep thla ta vek a. Tichuan, a sawisa ṭan ta a; tin, a chakna chu a bo ta vek mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, “Samson, Philistia-hovin an rawn bei dâwn a che,” a han ti a. Tin, a mu chu a han harh a, “Ni dang ang bawk khân ka chhuak leh mai ang a, ka tâl chhuak leh mai ang chu,” a ti a. Nimahsela, Lalpan a kalsan tawh tih rêng rêng a hre lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Philistia-ho chuan an man a, a mit an kher chhuahsak a; tin, Gaza khuaah an chhukpui a, dâr kawlte an buntîr ta a; lung inah buh a râwt sawm ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan, a lû meh hnu khan a sam a lo sei leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Philistia-ho mi liante chu an pathian Dagona hnêna inthawina ropui tak hlân tûr leh, inchawk hlim tûrin an pung khâwm chiam a: “Kan pathianin kan hmêlmapa Samsona min pe tawh alâwm,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, mipuite chuan an han hmuh chuan an pathian chu an fak a, “Kan pathianin kan hmêlmapa leh kan ram tichhetu, mi tam tak min thattupa chu kan kutah min pe ta alâwm,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, an thinlung a hlim lai tak chuan, “Samsona chu ennawm atân han ko teh u,” an ti a. Tichuan, Samsona chu lung in ata an va ko chhuak a, an hmaah chuan ennawmah a awm ta a; ban leh ban inkârah hian an dintîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Samsona chuan a kaitu naupang hnênah, “Hemi in dotu ban hi mi han dehtîr teh khai, ka han nghêng teh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chumi in chu mipa leh hmeichhiain an khat mup mai a. Philistia-ho mi lian zawng zawng chu chutah chuan an awm vek a; tin, Samsona ennawma thlîrtute chu in chungah chuan mipa leh hmeichhia sângthum lai an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Samsona chuan Lalpa chu a au va, “Aw Lalpa Pathian, khawngaih takin mi han hre reng langin, khawngaih takin tûn ṭumah chauh hian mi han tichak la, aw Pathian, ka mit khinghnih phuba hi Philistia-hote chungah hian ka han la thuai teh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Samsona chuan chumi in dotu ber sût pahnih chu a han dek a, a kut ding lamin pakhat a rinchhan a, a kut vei lamin pakhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Samsona chuan, “Philistia-ho hi ka han thihchilh teh ang!” a ti a. Tichuan, a theihtâwpin a kûn vak a; tin, mi liante leh mipui, a chhûnga awm zawng zawng chu in chim chuan a delh ta chiam mai a. Chutichuan, a dam laia a tihhlumte ai chuan a thihchilhte chu an tam zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tichuan, a unaute leh a pa chhûngte zawng zawng chu an lo chhuk a, an la a, an zâwn chho va, Zora leh Estaol inkâra a pa Manoa phûmna hmunah an phûm ta a. Tichuan, kum sawmhnih Israel-hote chungah ro a rêl a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Ephraim tlâng ramah mi pakhat a awm a, a hming chu Mika a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a nu hnênah, “Tangkarua sângkhat leh za an rûksak chia, nang pawhin ânchhia i lawha, ka beng hriat ngeia i sawi kha, ngai teh, kha tangkarua kha ka hnênah a awm asin, keima lâk a ni e,” a ti a. Tin, a nu chuan, “Ka fapa chu Lalpa malsâwmin awm rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, tangkarua sângkhat leh za chu a nu a pe leh a; tin, a nu chuan, “He tangkarua hi keima kut ngeiin ka fapa puala milem siam nân leh milema chhûn atân Lalpa hnênah ka hlân e; chuvângin, tûnah hian ka pe leh dâwn che a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, tangkarua chu a nu a han pêk chuan, a nu chuan tangkarua zahnih chu a la a, tangkaraw chhertu a pe a, ani chuan milemah a lo siam a, milemah a lo chhûng a; chu chu Mika inah chuan a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, chu Mika chuan pathiante in a nei a, ephod leh milemte a siam a, a fapa pakhat chu a puithiam atân a tihrang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chûng lai chuan Israel ramah lal an awm lo va; mi tinin mahni ṭha tih zâwng zâwngin an ti mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Bethlehem-juda-a mi Juda hnam, Levi chi tlangvâl pakhat a awm a, chutah chuan a va awm ve lawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chu mi chu Bethlehem-juda khawpui ata a chhuak a, awmna zawngin a vâk a ni a. Chutia a vahna lamah chuan Ephraim tlâng rama Mika in chu a va thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Mika chuan a hnênah, “Khawi aṭanga lo kal nge i nih le?” a ti a. Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “Bethlehem-juda-a mi Levi chi ka ni a, awmna hmun zawngin ka vâk a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Mika chuan a hnênah, “Ka hnênah hian awm ta che, ka paah leh puithiamah awm langin, kum tin tangkarua tlang sâwm ka pe ang chia, silhfên silh khat leh i ei tûrte pawh,” a ti a. Chutichuan, Levi chi chu a lût ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Levi chi chuan chu mi hnêna awm chu a remti ta a; tichuan, chu tlangvâl chu a fapa pakhatah a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Mika chuan Levi chi chu a tihrang ta a; tichuan, tlangvâl chu a puithiamah a lo awm a, Mika inah chuan a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, Mika chuan, “Tûnah zet chuan Levi chi ka puithiam atân ka nei tawh si a, Lalpan mi tihmuingîl ngei ang tih ka hria e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng lai chuan Israel ramah lal an awm lo va: tin, chûng lai chuan Dan chite chuan ram luah tûr an zawng a; chutih lai pawh chuan Israel chite zîngah ram luah tûr an la chang ve si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Dana thlahte chuan an hnam pum pui zînga mi, pasalṭha panga, Zora leh Estaol khua aṭangin ram va enthla tûr leh va thlîthlai tûrin an tîr a; an hnênah chuan, “Va kal ta ula, ram chu va thlîthlai teh u,” an ti a; tichuan, Ephraim tlâng rama Mika in chu an va thleng a, chutah chuan an riak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mika in kianga an awm lai chuan Levi chi tlangvâl aw chu an hria a, chu lam chu an va pan a, a hnênah, “Tuin nge hetah hian hruai che? He hmunah hian eng nge maw i tih le? Engtin nge hetah hian i khawsak?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Mika hian heti hian min lo siam ta a, mi ruai a, a puithiamah hian ka awm a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “Kan kalna tûrah hian kan hmuingîl dâwn nge dâwn lo tih kan hriat theih nân Pathian min râwnsak teh ang che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, puithiam chuan an hnênah, “Thlamuang takin kal tawh u. In kalna tûr chu Lalpan a hriatpui zêl a che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, mi pangate chu an chhuak ta a, Lais khuaah an va lût a, chuta mite chu Zidon mite ang bawka râlmuang tak leh thlamuang taka an awm hle hlezia an va hmu a; chumi ramah chuan eng maha han intichhe thei tûra thuneitu lêm chuang tu mah an awm lo va, Zidon-hote nên lah an inhlat a, inhmanna rêng rêng an nei si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Zora leh Estaol khuaa an unaute hnên lamah chuan an haw ta a; tin, an unaute chuan an hnênah, “Engtin nge ni le?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan, “Tho rawh u khai, i han bei ang u. Ram chu kan han hmu ta ngei mai a; ngai teh u, a ṭha hle a nia. In chechâng na nge? Chumi rama han lûta, han luah tûr chuan muang suh u khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In han kal chuan râlmuanga awm mite a nia in han hmuh ang ni, ram lah chu a zau si a. Pathianin a pe tawh che u a nia, leia thil awmah zawng eng mah tlâkchham tûr awm hauh lohna hmun a nia,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, Zora leh Estaol khua aṭang chuan Dan hnamte chu indona thuam inbelin mi zaruk an chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, an han chho va, Judai ram Kiriath-jearim khuaah awm hmun an han khuar a; chuvângin, chumi hmun chu tûn thlengin Mahane-dan an la ti a ni. Ngai teh, Kiriath-jearim thlang lama awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuta ṭang chuan Ephraim tlâng ram lam an pan a, Mika in chu an han thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lais ram enthla tûra mi panga chhuakte chuan an chhâng a, an unaute hnênah chuan, “Hêng inahte hian ephod te, milem te, milem siam chawp te, milem chhûn chawpte a awm tih in hria em? Chutichuan, engtin nge in tih dâwn ngaihtuah rawh u,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, chuta ta chu an pêng a, Levi chi tlangvâl awmna Mika in ngei chu an va thleng a, a chungchâng thu an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Dana thlah, mi zaruk indona thuam inbelte chu kulh kawngka bulah an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, mi panga, ram enthlatute chu an han chho va, an han lût a, milem siam chawp te, ephod te, milem te, milem chhûn chawpte chu an la a. Puithiam chu mi zaruk, indona thuam inbelte zîngah kulh kawngka bulah chuan a ding ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chûngte chu Mika ina an han luha, milem siam chawp te, ephod te, milem te, milem chhûn chawpte an han lâk chuan, puithiam chuan an hnênah, “Eng nge maw in tih chu le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan, “Ngawi rawh, i kutin i hmui kha hup la, kan hnênah lo kal ve la, kan paah leh puithiamah lo awm rawh. I tân hian chhûng khat chauh puithiama awm nge ṭha zâwk Israel zînga chi khat leh hnam khat puithiama awm?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, puithiam rilru chu a lâwm ta hle mai a; tichuan, ephod te, milem te, milem siam chawpte chu a la a, mipuiho zîngah chuan a tel ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutichuan, an kal chhuak ta a, an fanau tê tête, rante, bungruate chu an hmachhawm zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mika in aṭanga thui fe an kal hnu chuan Mika ṭhenawmte chu an inpun khâwm a, Dana thlahteho chu an va ûm pha ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Dana thlahteho chu an han au va. Tin, anni chu an lo lehhawi a, Mika hnênah chuan, “Eng i ti nge ni le, mi khati zozai i rawn kalpui mai?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Ka pathian siamte leh puithiam chu in kalpui a, in kal ta daih mai a, eng nge neih ka neih tâk ni? Eng titiha, ‘Eng i ti nge ni le?’ mi ti mai nge in nih chu le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Dana thlahteho chuan a hnênah, “Kan zîngah hian ṭawng mai mai suh khai; chuti lo zawng, mi thinchhe kut i tuar mai ang a, i chhûngte nên hian in nun in chân mai tûr a nia,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tichuan, Dana thlahteho chu an kal ta a. Tin, Mika chuan beih ngam rual niin a hre si lo va, a in lamah a haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Mika thilsiam leh a puithiam neih chu an kalpui ta a, Lais khua, râlmuanga awm hle hlete hnên chu an han thleng a, khandaihin an han that a; tin, khua chu an hâl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Zidon aṭanga a hlat êm avângin a han chhan chhuaktu tûr lah tu mah an awm si lo va, tute nên mah inzawmna rêng rêng an nei lo bawk a. Chumi hmun chu Beth-rehob bul ruama awm a ni. Tin, khua chu an din leh a, chutah chuan an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, a khaw hmingah chuan Israela fa, an thlahtu Dana chawiin Dan an vuah a. Amaherawhchu, a hma chuan chu khua chu Lais an ti ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Dana thlahte chuan milem siam chawp chu anmahni tân an lo din ta a; tin, Mosia fa Gersoma fapa Jonathana leh a fapate chu, ram chu miin an lâk hma loh chuan Dan chite puithiamah an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutichuan, Mika siam milem siam chawp chu Silo khuaa Pathian in a awm chhûng zawng chuan an din ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, chûng laia Israel rama lal an awm loh lai chuan Levi chi mi pakhat hi Ephraim tlâng ram tâwp lamah a awm a, Bethlehem-judai rama mi hmeiah a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, a hmei chuan a uiresan a; tichuan, Bethlehem-judai rama a pa hnênah a tlânsan a, chutah chuan thla li zet a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, a pasal chu a tho va, a chhiahhlawh leh sabengtung pahnih hruaiin tlang taka va thlêma, lungawia hruai haw leh tumin a va ûm zui a. Tin, ani chuan a pa inah chuan a lo hruai lût a; tin, nula pa chuan a hmuh chuan a lo lâwm hle mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, a pu, nula pa chuan a hnêna awm tûrin a lo chelh a; a hnênah chuan ni thum a awm a. Tichuan, an eiin an in tlâng a, chutah chuan a thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, a ni li ni chuan zîng takah an tho va, ani chu chhuah tumin a tho va; tin, nula pa chuan a mâkpa hnênah chuan, “Chhang tlêm tal eiin i thinlung chu tiharh rih la, chumi hnuah chuan in la kal ang chu maw le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, an ṭhu a, an pahnih chuan an eiin an in dûn a. Tin, nula pa chuan chu mi hnênah chuan, “Lungawi takin riak hrâm rawh khai, i thinlung chu hlim takin awm rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, chu mi chu chhuah tumin a han tho va; nimahsela, a pu chuan a thlêm chiam a; tichuan, a riak leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, a ni nga tûk zîng takah chuan chhuah tumin a tho va; tin, nula pa chuan, “I thinlung chu tiharh rih la maw le, tlai ni nêm hun thleng tal chuan awm rih rawh khai,” a ti a; tin, an pahnih chuan chaw te an ei dûn leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, chu mi chu a hmei nên, a chhiahhlawh nên chhuah tuma a han thawh chuan a pu, nula pa chuan a hnênah, “Ngai teh, hei khua pawh a tlai tawh a, zânin chu riak leh rih hrâm rawh khai. Ngai teh, khua pawh a thim hnai mai tawh alâwm; hetah hian riak leh la, i thinlung chu hlim taka a awm theih nân; tichuan, naktûk zîng takah i tho vang a, i haw mai tûr alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nimahsela, chu mi chuan chumi zân chuan riah a duh ta lo va, a tho va, a chhuak ta a, Jebus khaw zâwn a va thleng a (chu chu Jerusalem khua a ni), sabengtung pahnih thuam sa a hruai a; a hmei pawh chu a tel ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jebus khaw kiang an thlen chuan khua a tlai hle tawh a; tin, chhiahhlawh chuan a pu hnênah, “Hawh teh, he Jebus-ho khawpuiah hian i lût mai ang khai, i riak teh ang u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, a pu chuan a hnênah, “Israela thlahte ni si lo hnam dang khuaah te chuan lût lo ve; Gibea khaw lam i pan zêl zâwk ang u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, a chhiahhlawh hnênah, “Hawh, hêng hmun khawii zâwk emaw hi i pan ang; Gibea khuaah emaw, Rama khuaah emaw kan riak dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, an kal leh ta zêl a; Benjamin-ho Gibea khaw kiang an thlen chuan ni a tla ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Gibea khuaa riak tûr chuan an lût ta a. Tin, a lût a, chu khawpui khawlaiah chuan a ṭhu a, tu mah thleng peih rêng rêng an awm lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, putar pakhat hi tlaiah chuan a feh a lo hâwng a; chu mi chu Ephraim tlâng rama mi a ni a, Gibea khuaah chuan a va awm rih lawk a ni; chumi hmuna mite erawh chu Benjamina chite an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, a han hawi a, khawlaia mikhualpa chu a han hmu a; tin, putar chuan, “Khawiah nge i kal dâwn le? Khawi aṭanga lo kal nge i nih?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “Bethlehem-judai ram aṭanga Ephraim tlâng tâwp ram lama kal tum ka ni; chuta awm chu ka ni. Bethlehem-judai ramah ka va kal a; tûnah hian Lalpa inah kal ka tum a ni. Mahse, tu mah mi thleng peih an awm lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kan sabengtung tân phei chuan buhpâwl leh ran chawte zawng kan nei a; tin, kei leh, i bâwihnu leh, i chhiahhlawhte hnêna awm ve tlangvâl tân te pawh hian chhang leh uain a awm bawk a; eng mah tlâkchham zawng kan nei hauh lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, putar chuan, “Thlamuang takin awm rawh khai! I mamawh zawng zawng chu keiman ka tum vek ang e; khawlaiah zawng riak lul suh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutichuan, a inah a hruai lût a, sabengtungte chu chaw a pe a. Tin, an kete an sil a, an eiin an in ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutia hlim leh lâwm taka an awm lai chuan, ngai teh, chumi khuaa mi, Beliala fapa ṭhenkhat chuan in chu an rawn hual vêl ta hlawm a, kawngkhâr an rawn chhu dawt dawt a. In neitupa putar hnênah chuan, “I ina lo thlengpa kha han hruai chhuak rawh, kan lo pâwl teh ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, in neitupa chu an hnênah a va chhuak a, an hnênah chuan, “Ni lo ve, ka unaute u! Chuti êma sual chu ti lul suh u khai! He mi hi ka mikhual a nih hi, hetiang thil âtthlâk tak zawng ti lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ngai teh u, hetah hian ka fanu nula leh a hmei an awm a; anni chu ka rawn hruai chhuak ang a, anni chu tlâwm ula, ṭha in tih ang apiangin an chungah ti nâng che u; he mi chungah erawh hi chuan chutiang thil âtthlâk chu ti suh ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nimahsela, chu mite chuan a thu an pawm duh lo va. Chutichuan, mi chuan a hmei chu a hruai a, an hnênah chuan a va hruai chhuak ta a. Tin, anni chuan an lo pâwl a, khawvâr hma loh chuan zankhuain an sawisa hrep a; tin, khua a lo vâr veleh an chhuah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chutichuan, hmeichhia chu khua a lo vâr veleh a kal a, a hotupa thlen inpa kawngka bulah chuan a tlu thlawp a, khaw ên hnu thlengin a awm ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, a hotupa chu zîngah chuan a han tho va, kawngkate chu a han hawng a, kal tumin a va chhuak a; ngai teh, a hmeinu chu kawngka bulah chuan rahkaah a lo tlu zangphar dêr mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “Tho rawh, i kal ang,” a han ti a; nimahsela, a chhâng ta hauh lo mai a. Tichuan, a sabengtung chungah a hlâng a; tin, a tho va, a hmun lamah chuan a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, in a va thlen chuan chemtê a la a, a hmei chu a fûke hmun sâwm leh hmun hnihah a chan sawm a, Israel ram zawng zawngah a thawn darh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, a lo hmu apiang chuan, “Israela thlahte Aigupta ram ata an lo chhuah achin hetiang thiltih rêng rêng hi tûn thleng hian a la awm ngaiin hmuh a la ni ngai hauh lo mai. Ngaihtuah ula, inrâwn ula, sawi teh u,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israela thlahte zawng zawng chu an thawk ta chiam a, thu khat vuain Dan khua aṭanga Beer-seba khaw thlengin Gilead rama mite nên Mizpe khuaah Lalpa hnênah an inkhâwm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, mi zawng zawng hotute, Israel chite zawng zawng lam pawh chu Pathian mite inkhâwmhonaah chuan an va tel a, sipai khandaih keng mi nuai li an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />(Benjamina thlahte chuan Israela thlahte chu Mizpe khuaah an han chho tih an lo hria a.) Tin, Israela thlahte chuan, “Engtiziaa hetianga suahsualna hi lo awm nge ni min hrilh teh u?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Levi chi, hmeichhia an thaha pasal chuan, “Benjamin chite awmna Gibea khuaah ka hmei nên riah tumin kan va lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Gibea mite chuan min rawn bei ta mai a, zânah in an rawn hual a. Mi thah an tum a, ka hmei chu an sawisa hrep a, a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, ka hmei ruang chu ka la a, ka chan a, Israel-ho ram luah zawng zawngah ka thawn darh a; Israel ramah hian thil tenawm tak leh âtthlâk tak an lo ti ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangni Israela thlahte u, in vai hian ngai teh u, in ngaih dân leh in remtih dân chu sawi rawh u khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, mipuiho zawng zawng chu thu khat vuain an tho ṭhup a, “Tu mah mahni puan in lamah kan haw hauh lo vang a, tu mah mahni inah kan lût hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gibea-ho kan tih dân tûr chu hetiang hi a ni: ṭhum kan vâwr ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel-hote chunga thil dik lo tak an tih ang zêla an tiha, Gibea hmuna Benjamin-ho kan han beihnaa mipuite ei tûr lo hlântu atân Israel hnam zawng zawng zînga mi zaah sâwm zêl, sângkhatah za zêl, sîngkhatah sâng zêl kan thlang chhuak ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israel mi zawng zawng chu thu khat vaw ṭhapin chu khawpui bei tûr chuan an pung khâwm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Israel hnamte chuan Benjamin hnam zawng zawngte hnênah chuan, “In zînga hetiang suahsualna lo awm ta mai hi engtizia nge ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gibea khuaa mi Beliala fate chu rawn hruai rawh u; tichuan, Israel rama sual hi a reh theih nân kan lo tihlum ang e,” tiin mi an tîr a. Nimahsela, Benjamin chite chuan an unau Israela thlahte thusawi chu an pawm duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Benjamina thlahte chu Israela thlahte do tûrin khawpui atate an lo chhuak khâwm a, Gibea khuaah an lût chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, chumi nia Benjamina thlahte khawpui ata khandaih kenga chhuakho chu, Gibea khuaa mi zasarih thlan ṭhiau tiam lovin sînghnih leh sângruk an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chûng zawng zawng zîngah chuan veikhawr zasarih, thlan ṭhiau an awm a; an vai chuan virvawma samzai tia pawh ṭhelh hlek lo mi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Israel mite chu Benjamin mite tiam lovin khandaih keng mi ṭhiau nuai li an ni; chûngho zawng zawng chu indo mi vek an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chu an tho va, Bethel-ah an han chho va, Pathian an han râwn a, “Benjamina thlahte chu tu nge han bei hmasa ang le?” an ti a. Tin, Lalpan , “Juda-ho han kal hmasa rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, Israela thlahte chu zîngah an tho va, Gibea khua chu an han hual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Israel mite chu Benjamin-ho bei tûr chuan an thawk a; tin, Israel mite chuan Gibea khuaah chuan anmahni bei tûrin ṭan an han siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Benjamina thlahte chu Gibea khua ata chu an lo chhuak a, chumi ni chuan Israel-hote zînga mi sînghnih leh sânghnih an rawn that ta buaih mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, mipuiho, Israel mite chu an han infuih leh a, an beih ṭan nia an beihna hmunah vêk chuan bei tûrin ṭan an han siam leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />(Tin, Israela thlahte chu an han chho va, Pathian hmaah tlai thlengin an han ṭap a, “Kan unau Benjamina thlahte hi bei tûrin kan han thawk leh dâwn em ni ang?” tin Lalpa an zâwt a. Tin, Lalpa chuan, “Han bei leh rawh u,” a ti a.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, a ni hnih ni chuan Israela thlahte chuan Benjamina thlahte chu an han hnaih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Benjamin-ho pawh chu a ni hnih ni chuan bei tûrin Gibea khua ata an chhuak ve a, Israela thlahte zînga mi sîngkhat leh sângriat an rawn that leh ta buaih mai a, chûng zawng zawng chu khandaih keng mi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chutichuan, Israela thlahte zawng zawng leh mipuiho zawng zawng chu an han chho va, Bethel-ah an han kal a, an ṭap a, Lalpa hmaah an ṭhu a, chumi ni chuan tlai thlengin chaw an nghei a; tin, Lalpa hnênah hâlral thilhlan leh remna thilhlante an hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chuan Lalpa an râwn a (chûng lai chuan chutah chuan Pathian thuthlung bâwm chu a awm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />tin, chûng lai chuan Arona fa Eleazara fapa Phinehasa chuan a rawng a bâwl ṭhîn a ni a), “Kan unau Benjamina thlahte chu kan han bei leh ang nge kan bânsan tawh mai ang?” tiin. Tin, Lalpan , “Han chho rawh u, naktûkah zawng in kutah ka pe tawh dâwn e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Israel-hote chuan Gibea khaw vêlah chuan chângtu an indah ru ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chu Benjamina thlahte bei tûrin a ni thum ni chuan an han thawk leh a, ni dang ang bawk khân Gibea khaw bei tûr chuan ṭan an han siam leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Benjamina thlahte chu mite bei tûr chuan an va chhuak a, khua chu an chhuahsan a; tichuan, ni dang ang bawk khân mite chu beiin an that ṭan leh ta mai a, phûl faia Bethel khaw chhohna leh Gibea khaw kawng lamlianahte chuan Israel-hote chu sawmthum an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Benjamina thlahte chuan, “A hma ang bawk khân kan hmaah an tlâwm leh ta le,” an ti a. Israela thlahte erawh chuan, “I tlân ang u khai, khawpui ata hi lamlian lamah i tawlh chhuahtîr ang u,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tichuan, Israel-ho zawng zawng chuan an ṭanhmun chu an chhuahsan a, Baal-tamar hmunah ṭanhmun an siam a. Tin, Israel-ho, lo châng rutute kha an chânna hmun Maaregeba hmun ata an lo chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, Israel-ho zawng zawng zînga thlan ṭhiau sîngkhatin Gibea khua chu an bei a, an inbei chu a nasa ngei mai. Nimahsela, Benjamin-ho chuan an chan a chhe dâwn ta ngei mai tih zawng an hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Benjamin-ho chu Israel-hote hmaah chuan a tihlum chiam a. Israela thlahte chuan chumi ni chuan Benjamin-ho chu mi sînghnih leh sângnga leh za an that a; chûngho zawng zawng chu khandaih keng mi vek an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chutichuan, Benjamina thlahte chuan an tlâwm ta tih an lo inhre ta a. Israela thlahte chuan Gibea khaw bei tûra a rûka chângtute an dah kha an rin avângin Benjamin-ho chu an han hnungtawlhsan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, a rûka chângtute chuan Gibea khua chu an bawh ta thut a; tichuan, a rûka chângtute chu an inzâr darh a, khuaa mi zawng zawng chu khandaihin an bei ta chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Israel-hote leh a rûka chângtute khân an intiamna chu khawpui chhûnga mei tihkhûk ngut ngut a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, Israel-hote chu an han tawlh rih a; tichuan, Benjamin-ho chuan an han bei ṭan a, Israel mite chu sawmthum lai an that a, “Kan inbeih tirh ni ang bawk khân kan hmaah an tlâwm leh ta ngei mai le,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Nimahsela, khawpui chhûngah chuan meikhu a lo din tâk luah veleh Benjamin-ho chu an han lehhawi a; tin, ngai teh, khawpui chu a pumin vân lamah a khu chho ta ngut ngut mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tichuan, Israel-hote chu an rawn inher leh ta a; Benjamin-ho chuan mak an ti hle a, an chan a chhe dâwn tih an hre ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Chuvângin, Israel-hote hmaah chuan thlalêr lamah an tlânchhe ta a; nimahsela, an ûm zui ngat ngat a; tin, khawpui ata lo chhuakte chuan chutah chuan an lo tihlum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Benjamin mite chu an hual ta tlat a, an ûm a, ni chhuahna lam Gibea dep an chawlhna hmunah an ûm pha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Benjamin-ho chu mi sîngkhat leh sângriat an thi a; an vai chuan mi chak huaisen ṭhiau an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tin, an tawlh a, thlalêr lam Rimon lungpuiah an tlânchhia a; mi sângnga chu lamlianahte an râwt a. Tichuan, Gidom thlengin an ûm zui ngat ngat a, mi sanghnih an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Chutichuan, chumi nia Benjamin-ho thi zawng zawngte chu khandaih keng mi ṭhiau sînghnih leh sângnga an ni a, an vai chuan mi chak huaisen an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Mi zaruk erawh chu thlalêr lam Rimon lungpuiah an tlânchhia a, chumi Rimon lungpuiah chuan thla li an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tin, Israel-hote chu Benjamin-ho chungah chuan an thawk leh a, khawpui chhûnga mi tawh phawt chu ran te, an hmuh apiangte chu khandaihin an sât hlum zêl a. Chu lo pawh chu khua an hmuh apiangte pawh chu an hâl zêl a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Israel mite chuan Mizpe khuaah, “Kan zînga mi tu mahin kan fanute hi Benjamin-ho nupuiah i neihtîr hauh suh ang u,” tiin chhia an chham a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, mipuiho chu Bethel-ah an kal a, Pathian hmaah tlai thlengin an ṭhu a, an awte chhuahin an ṭap vak vak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Aw Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian, eng tizia nge Israel-te zînga hetiang thil hi a lo awma, vawiinah hian Israel-te hi hnam khata kim ta lo nge ni le?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, a tûkah chuan mipuiho chu zîng takah an tho va, chutah chuan maichâm an siam a, hâlral thilhlante leh remna thilhlante an hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chuan, “Israel hnam zawng zawng zînga Lalpa hnêna pung khâwmho zînga han tel ve lo chu tute nge ni le?” an ti a. Mizpe khuaa Lalpa hnêna han kal ve lo apiangte chu, “Tihhlum ngei tûr a ni ang,” tiin chhia an lo chham tawh tlat si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Israela thlahte chu an unau Benjamin-ho chungchângah chuan an inchhîr ta a, “Vawiinah hian Israel-ho zînga hnam khat chu chhawk an ni ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A awm chhunate tân chuan an nupui tûr engtin nge kan tih tâk ang le? Kan fanute hi nupuiah neihtîr hauh lo tûrin Lalpa hming chhâlin chhia kan chham ta si a,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan, “Israel-ho hnam zînga mi tu hnam ber nge ni Mizpe khuaa Lalpa hmaa han inlan ve lo hi le?” an ti a. Tin, ngai teh, pung khâwmho awmna hmunah chuan Jabes-gilead mite chu pakhat mah an kal ve lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mipuiho an han inchhiar chuan, ngai teh, Jabes-gilead rama awmte chu pakhat mah an lo awm lah lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, inkhâwmhote chuan mi huaisen ṭha ṭhiau sîngkhat leh sânghnih an tîr a, “Kal ta ula, Jabes-gilead rama awmte chu hmeichhia leh an fanau tê tête nên khandaihin va sât hlum vek rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />In tih dân tûr chu hetiang hi a ni: mipa zawng zawng leh hmeichhia, mipa mutpui tawh phawt chu tiboral vek ang che u,” tiin thu an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Jabes-gilead rama awmte zîngah chuan nula zali, mipa la pâwl ngai hauh loh an hmu a; tichuan, an awmna Silo khuaah chuan an hruai a, chu chu Kanaan ram a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, inkhâwmho zawng zawngte chuan mi an tîr a, Rimon lungpuia awm Benjamin-ho an va bia a, an hnênah inrem thu an puang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, chu veleh chuan Benjamin-ho chu an kîr a, Jabes-gilead rama hmeichheho an zuahte chu an pe a; chuti chung pawhin an la indaih ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Israel hnam zînga Lalpan intihhranna a lo siam tâk avângin mipuiho chu Benjamin-ho chungchângah chuan an inchhîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, inkhâwmho upate chuan, “A la damte nupui tûr hi engtin nge kan tih ang le, Benjamin-ho zînga an hmeichhiate chu tihboral an lo ni ta si a?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Israel hnam hi tihmanga a awm loh nân Benjamin-ho la awm chhunate hi engtin nge thlah kan neihtîr theih ang le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kan fanute hi nupuiah kan neihtîr thei si lo va,” an ti a; Israela thlahte chuan, “Tu pawh Benjamin-ho nupuia neihtîr apiang chu ânchhe dawngin awm rawh se,” tiin chhia an lo chham tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan, “Ngai teh u, Bethel hmâr lam, Bethel aṭanga Sekem kalna lamlian chhak lampanga Lebona chhim lama awm Silo khuaah kum tin Lalpa tân kût a awm ṭhin kha,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan Benjamina thlahteho hnênah chuan, “Va kal ta ula, grêp hmunah va châng ru tawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tin, lo thlîr ula; tichuan, ngai teh u, Silo khuaa nulaho chu lâmnaa lâm tûra an lo chhuah chuan, grêp hmun ata chu lo chhuak ula, Silo nulaho chu mahni nupui atân man ṭheuh ula; tichuan, Benjamin-ho ramah kal vek ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, an pate emaw, an nuṭate emaw, sawisêl tûra kan hnêna an lo kal leh an hnênah, ‘Min khawngaih rawh u khai, indonaah khân an nupui tûr kan lo mansak ṭheuh ta si lo va; nangni lahin in lo pe bawk si lo va; lo pe ni ula, thiam loh in hlawh dâwn si a,’ kan lo ti dâwn nia,” tiin thu an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Benjamina thlahte chuan chutiang chuan an ti a, lâmho zînga mi anmahni zât ṭheuh nupuiah an man a, an kal bopui ta a; tin, an ram lamah chuan an hâwng a, khawpuite chu an chei leh a, chutah chuan an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, chu veleh chuta ṭang chuan Israela thlahte chu mahni chi chi leh mahni hnam hnamin an intêl hrang leh a, chuta ta chu anmahni ram ṭheuhvah chuan an haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chûng lai chuan Israel-te zîngah lal rêng rêng an awm lo va; mi tinin mahni ṭha tih zâwng zâwngin an ti mai a ni.
  </para>
</usx>
